<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">Kisimnabu</book>
  <para style="h">Kisimnabu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kisimnabu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kisimnabu</para>
  <para style="mt">Kisimnabu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipata ahing pawtdoh nua uh kum nina, hanina, ani khat niin, Sinai gamdai a a umna uh kimutuona biehbuh sungah Mangpa’n Mosi kungah tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel tate mipi umkhawmte zousie, aphung aphung in, ahainet ahainet in, amin uh dungzui in pasal um zousie sim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel sunga galdou dinga kuon thei, kum sawmni apat atunglam zousie apawl pawlin nang leh Aaron in na sim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh phung zousie, ahainet sung chiet ua akhai pa chiet, nouma toh na kung uah a um ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamte khu na kung ua, nouma toh um khawm ding te ahi uhi: Reuben phungah Shedeur tapa Elizur;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Simeon phungah Zurishaddai tapa Shelumiel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda phungah Amminadab tapa Nahshon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Issakar phungah Zuar tapa Nethaneel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zebulun phungah Helon tapa Eliab.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joseph tate lah ah: Ephraim phunga Ammihud tapa Elishama; Manasseh phungah Pedahzur tapa Gamaliel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Benjamin phungah Gideon tapa Abidan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dan phungah Ammishaddai tapa Ahiezer.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asher phungah Okran tapa Pagiel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gad phunga Deuel tapa Eliasaph.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naphtali phungah Enan tapa Ahira.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamte khu mipi kikhawm ten atel doh uh phung zousie zungpipa chiet leh hainet upa chiet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mosi leh Aaron in tana amin chiet ua kiloute azawpi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh amauten mipi umkhawm zousie khu aha nina ani khat niin a hankhawm ua, aphung aphung in, ahainet ahainet a amin uh kizawmdan dungzuiin kum sawmni akipat atunglam zousie amauh suongtu apu apate uh min atahlang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin amaute Sinai gamdai ah asimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tapa upapen Reuben tate khu ahainet, ahainet u’leh aphung aphung un, amin uh akizomdan dungzuiin, pasal kum sawmni akipat atunglam galkap dia kuon thei zousie a sim ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Reuben phung a asim za uh, tul sawmli leh tul guh leh zanga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Simeon tate akhang u’leh aphung aphung leh ahainet ahainet dung zui ua, amin uh kizom dan in, Pasal kumsawmni akipat atunglam gal kuon thei zousie a sim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Simeon phunga asim za uh, tul sawmnga leh tul kuo leh zathum ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gad tate akhang u’leh aphung u’leh ahainet dung zui ua, amin uh kizomdan in, pasal kum sawmni akipat atunglam galdou a kuon thei zousie asim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gad phunga asim za uh, tul sawmli leh tul nga leh zaguh leh sawmnga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Juda tate akhang u’leh aphung uh, tualeh ahainet, hainet dungzui ua, amin uh ki zom dan in pasal kum sawmni akipat atunglam, galkuon thei, zousie asim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Juda phunga asim za uh, tul sawmsagi leh tul li leh za guh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Issakar tate akhang u’leh, aphung u’leh, ahainet ahainet ua, amin uh kizomdan dungzuiin, Pasal kum sawmni akipat atunglam gal kuon thei zousie a sim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Issakar phunga asim za uh, tul sawmnga leh tul li leh za li ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zebulun tate akhang u’leh, aphung ua, tualeh a hainet ahainet ua, amin uh kizom dan dungzui in, Pasal kum sawmni akipat atunglam, gal kuon thei zousie asim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jebulun phunga asim za uh, tul sawmnga leh tulsagi leh zali ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Joseph tate chipen Ephraim tate akhang u’leh aphung uh tualeh ahainet ahainet ua, amin uh kizom dan dungzuiin, pasal kum sawmni akipat atunglam gal kuon thei zousie asim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ephraim phunga asim za uh, tul sawmli leh za nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Manasseh tate akhang u’leh aphung uh tualeh ahainet ahainet dungzui ua, amin uh kizom dan dungzuiin, Pasal kum sawmni akipat atunglam gal kuon thei zousie a sim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Manasseh phunga asim za uh, tul sawmthum leh tul ni leh za ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Benjamin tate akhang u’leh aphung, aphung u’leh ahainet ahainet dungzui ua, amin uh kizomdan dungzui in, pasal kum sawmni akipat atunglam gal kuon thei zousie, asim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Benjamin phunga asim za uh, tul sawmthum leh tul nga leh zali ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dan tate akhang u’leh aphung aphung u’leh ahainet ahainet ua amin uh kizom dan dungzuiin pasal kum sawmni akipat atunglam, galkuon thei zousie, asim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Dan phunga asim za uh, tul sawmguh leh tulni leh za sagi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Asher tate akhang u’leh aphung aphung u’leh ahainet ahainet dungzui ua, amin uh kizom dan dungzui in, pasal kum sawmni akipat atunglam gal kuon thei zousie asim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Asher phunga asimza uh, tul sawmli leh tul khat leh za nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Naphtali tate akhang u’leh aphung aphung uh tualeh ahainet ahainet ua, amin uh kizom dung zuiin, pasal kum sawmni apat atunglam gal kuon thei zousie asim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Naphtali phunga asim za uh, tul sawm nga leh tul thum leh zali ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tamte ahi uh, Mosi leh Aaron in Israel nam lamkai sawmleni asimte uh, amaute aphung sung chiet ua u pate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate aphung aphung un, kum sawmni apat atunglam, gal kuonthei zousie Israel gam ah asim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Asim zousie uh a bawnun, tul za guh leh tul sawm thum leh za nga leh sawm nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hinanleh Levimite suongtu apu apate uh pen alah uah asimtel sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n Mosi kungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Levi phungpen na sim sih dinga, Israel tate lah ah zong amaute na sim tel lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hinanleh Levimite pen theipina biehbuh enkol ding leh, asunga vanzah zousie leh van um zousie kem dinga na guot ding ahi. Amauten biehbuh apoding ua, avanzah zousie toh, Tualeh tuate zousie a enkol ding ua, biehbuh akim kot in a imkhum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tualeh biehbuh akisuon ding chiengin Levi miten aphet ding ua, tualeh biehbuh tunding ahi chiengin, Levimite ma in atung ding uhi; namdang mi akung nai a ahing pei leh thalup ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten ama uh mun chiet ah apawl pawl in atam dan uh dungzui zelin apuon innte uh azah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Hinanleh Levimiten theipina biehbuh kim kot in apuon innte uh azah ding uhi; Israel mipi kikhawmte tunga lungthahna atun louna dingin Levimiten theipina biehbuh a enkol ding uhi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten Mangpa’n Mosi athupieh zousie dungzuiin tuabangin abawl ta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi leh Aaron ahoupi a akung uah tam bangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel tate’n aphung chiemtena puonlap uh taa chiet in apawl uh bawl dan bangin a puon inn uh azah ding uhi: kimutuona biehbuh nai senglou in akimkot in biehbuh lam ngat chietin azah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nisuohna lam suolam pangah apawl uh tamdan dungzuiin Juda pawlin Puonzah azah ding uhi. Amminadab tapa Nahshon khu Judate lamkai ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh galkap pawl sima umte tamdan, tul sawmsagi leh tul li leh zaguh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh aban a puoninn zah ding Issakar phung ahi dinga; Zuar tapa Nethaneel khu Issakarte lamkai ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh galkap pawl sima umte tamdan tul sawmnga leh tul li leh za li ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaban ah Zebulun phung ahi dinga, tualeh Helon tapa Eliab khu Zebulun tate lamkai ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh galkap pawl sima umte tamdan, tul sawmnga leh tul sagi leh za li ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Apawl uh tamdan bangzela Juda pawl lah a simtelte tamdan tul za leh tul sawm giet leh guh leh zali ahi uhi. Amauten ma apui zel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Simlam pangah: Reuben pawlte apawl uh tam dan dungzuiin a um ding uhi: Reuben tate lamkai dingin Shedeur tapa Elizur ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh galkap pawl sima umte tamdan tul sawmli leh tul guh leh za nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh ama kunga puon inn zah ding khu Simeon phung ahi dinga: Simeon tate lamkai ding khu Zurishaddai tapa Shelumiel ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh galkap pawl sima umte tamdan khu tul sawmnga leh tul kuo leh zathum ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ban ah Gad phung ahi dinga, tualeh Gad tate lamkai dingin, Reuel tapa Eliasaph ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh galkap pawl sima umte tamdan, tul sawmli leh tul nga leh zaguh leh sawm nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Apawl uh tamdan dungzuia Reuben pawl a sim telte tamdan tul za leh tul sawmnga leh khat leh zali leh sawm nga ahi uhi. Amaute aguolni na ah apei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tuachi’n kimutuona biehbuh apat apawt doh dinga, Levimite khu alai ah a um ding ua, Amauh diellap chiet toh gieh phuol abawl bangun apei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tumlam pangah: Ephraim pawl, akichiemtena uh puonlap taa in atamdan dungzui un a um ding ua, Ephraim tate lamkai ding Ammihud tapa Elishama ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A galkap sima umte tamdan tul sawmli leh za nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh aban ah Manasseh phung a um dinga, Manasseh tate lamkai Pedahzur tapa Gamaliel ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh agalkap pawl sima umte tam dan tul sawmthum leh tul ni leh zani ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuazouin Benjamin phung ahi dinga, Benjamin tate lamkai, Gideon tapa Abidan ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh agalkap pawl sima umte tamdan, tul sawm thum leh nga leh zali ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ephraim giehphuol a mipite apawl apawl a akisim leh tul za leh giet leh za khat ahi uhi. Mailam nawt a apei chiengun amaute a guol thumna ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Mallam pangah: atam dan dungzui un Dan phungte a um ding ua; Dan tate lamkai Ammishaddai tapa Ahiezer ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh agalkap pawl sima umte tamdan tul sawmguh leh tul ni leh za sagi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh aban ua puon zah dingte, Asher phung ahi ahi ding a, Asher tate lamkai Okran tapa Pagiel ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh agalkap pawl sima umte tamdan tul sawmli leh tul khat leh za nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ban ah Naphtali phungin puonbuh azah ding ua Naphtali tate lamkai Enan tapa Ahira ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh a galkap pawl sima umte tamdan tul sawm nga leh tul thum leh zali ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Dan pawla sima um zousiete tamdan tul za leh tul sawmnga leh tul sagi leh zaguh ahi uhi. Amaute apuonlap utoh aguol nukhia pen ah apei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tamte Israel tate aphung aphung ua kisimte ahi ua, agieh phuol ua, mipi kisim zousie agawmkhawm in tul zaguh leh tul thum leh za nga leh sawmnga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh Levi mitepen Israel tate lah a simtel ahi sih uhi; Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh zousie dungzuiin abawl ua; tuabangin apawl apawlin puon inn azah ua, Tualeh aphung aphung leh ahainet ahainet dung zuiun akipan khezel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tamte khu Sinai muoltunga Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi lai a, Aaron leh Mosi hahlesuonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh tamte khu Aaron tapate min ahi uhi; a upa pen Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar leh Ithamar ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tamte khu Aaron tapate siempu nasem ding a sathau nu a namdet a umte min ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nadab leh Abihu in Sinai gamdai a Mangpa masang a, mei sienglou alat ziehun Mangpa masang ah ashita uhi. Amauten tapa anei sih uhi: Tuachi’n Eleazar leh Ithamar in apa uh Aaron damsung tengin siempu nna asem tawntung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Levi phung khu siempu Aaron kung ah hing zawpi inlen ana asep pieh theina dingun akung ah um sahin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh amauten biehbuh nasem in, kimutuona biehbuh masangah akul leh poimaw bangzel in ama leh mipite’n nna asem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh kimutuona biehbuh sunga vanzah zousie akemding ua, Israel tate a dingin biehbuh nasep asem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Levimite pen Aaron leh atapate kungah na pe ding a: amaute khu Israel tate lah a kipata a pumpia akunga pieh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Aaron leh atapate na teldoh dinga, siempu hina nasep asem den ding uhi; namdang hing kigolkha a um leh thalia ahi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ngaiin Keima’n Levimite khu, Israel tate lah a kipat ta masa naubu hong masapen zousie taangin Israelte lah a kipat ka lata hi. Tuaziehin Levite khu keia ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tachil zousie lah kei a ahi ngal a, Izipt gam a tachil pieng masa zousie, mihing hiin ganta hitaleh kei a dinga ka koi siengthou ahita hi. Keima Mangpa kahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Sinai gamdai ah Mosi ahoupi a akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Levi tate aphung aphung, ahainet ahainet in sim inlen; pasal ha khat a kipat atunglam zousie nasim ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in akunga thu kipie dungzui leh Mangpa thu bang in amaute asim ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tamte khu amin uh dungzui a Levi tapate ahi uhi: Gershon, Kohath leh Merari;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh tamte khu aphung dung zui un Gershon tapate min ahi uh; Libni leh Shimei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh aphung dungzui zel un Kohath tapate, Amram Izehar, Hebron leh Uzziel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh aphung dungzui ua Merari tapate, Mahli leh Mushi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gershon apat Libnite phung leh Shimeite phung ahing umdoh a, tamte khu Gershon hahlesuonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasal hakhat apat atunglam min sima um zousie a unin tul sagi leh zanga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Gershon phung miten, biehbuh tumlam pangah apuonbuh uh azah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Gershon tate lamkai ding Lael tapa Eliasaph ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Gershon taten kimutuona biehbuh akep ding ukhu biehbuh leh atung khunate, kimutuona biehbuh a puonzahte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahuongsung puonzahte, biehbuh huongsung tunkot leh maitam kimvel a puonzahte, tualeh, tua mun a nasepna zousie a zah ding khaute ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Kohath apat Amram mite phung Izharmite phung leh Hebronmite phung leh Uzzielmite phung ahing umdoh hi; tamte khu Kohath mite innkuonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasal ha khat akipat atunglam min sim a um zousiete aun un tul giet leh za guh ahi ua mun siengthou kem dingte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kohath tapaten biehbuh simlam pangah apuon inn uh azah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Kohathmite lamkai ding khu Uzziel tapa Elizaphan ahiding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amaute etkol ding khu Thuhun bawm, dawkan, thaumei tunna, maitamte, munsiengthou sunga Siempu nasepna a vanzah umlebelte leh munsiengthoupen lutna kot a puonzahte leh tam vanzah zousie toh kisai a mawpuohna nei ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Siempu Aaron tapa Eleazar khu Levimite lamkaite lamkai lienpen ahi dinga, mun siengthou etkolna ah houtu ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh Merari apat Mahlite phung leh Mushite phung ahing umdoh hi. Tamte Merari phungte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh pasal ha khat apat atunglam min sima um zousie, tul guh leh zani ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh Merari phungte upa pen Abihail tapa Zuriel ahi; Amauten biehbuh sahlam pang ah apuon innte uh azah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Merari tapate etkol dinga kiguot khu biehbuh singpehte a zawlte, akhuomte, khuom phuna khuohkuohte, umlebelte zousie leh nasepna a vanzahte zousie ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh ahuong kimkot a khuomte leh akhuom ngahna khuohkuohte, akilbehnate leh akhaute toh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuaban ah nisuonalam biehbuh mai a kimutuona biehbuh mai a, suolam panga Puon inn zah ding khu Mosi leh Aaron leh atapate ahi ding ua, Israeltate taangin munsiengthou a enkol ding uhi. Namdang mi akung nai ua ahing pei leh thalup in a um ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mangpa thupieh banga Mosi leh Aaron in a aphung phunga pasal hakhat apat atunglam zousie asimte uh tul sawmni leh tul ni ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi kungah, “Israel tate lah ah tachil pasal ha khat apat atunglam zousie sim inlen amin uh giel lut in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Levimite khu kei a tuom ahi ua (Kei Mangpa khu Ka hi). Israel tate lah a tachil piengmasa zousie taangin na la ding hi, tualeh Levimite gantate khu Israel ganta pieng masapen taangin na la ding ahi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n thu apieh bangin Mosi in Israel tate lah a tachil zousie a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tachil pasal amin uh kizom bang zel un, ha khat a upa apat atunglam a sim zousie uh, tul sawmni leh tul ni leh zanile sawm sagi leh thum ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Levimite khu Israel tate lah a tachil zousie taangin la inlen, tualeh Levimite ganta khu agantate uh taangin lain; Levimite kei a ahi ding uh: Kei Mangpa khu ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh Levimite sanga atam zohna uh, Israel tate tachil zani leh sawm sagi leh thumte tatna dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mi khat ah Shekel nga chiet na la ding hi, mun siengthou a shekel dungzuiin (Shekel khat khu Gerah sawmni ahi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh tatna sum avalteng khu Aaron leh atapate na pieh ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levimiten atatzou ban ua umnalai tatna sumte khu Mosi in ala a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Israel tate tachil lah a kipat in sum khu ala a, munsiengthou shekel dungzuiin shekel tul khat leh zathum leh sawm guh leh nga, ala hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin, Mangpa thu dungzuiin Mosi in tatna sumte khu Aaron leh atapate kungah apie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi leh Aaron ahoupi a akung uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Levi tapate laha kipat in Kohath tapate aphung aphung u’leh ahainet ahainet un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sawmthum apat atunglam kum sawm nga tanchieng kimutuona biehbuh a, nasem thei ding zousie sim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kimutuona biehbuh mun siengthou pen a Kohath tapate nasep ding khu tamte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ummun akisuon ding chiengun Aaron leh atapate ahing pei ding ua, mun siengthou puonzah alakhe ding ua, theipina bawm akhu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh atungah saham vun akoi ding ua, tuami tungah, puon apum tanga dumin akhu ding ua, azawnna zawlte avaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh tanghousie dawkan tungah puondum apha ding ua, tuami tungah, kuongte, tawkeute, hengte leh asitnate akoi ding uhi; tualeh kitatlou in, tanghousie khu tuami tungah a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh tuate tungah Puonsandup apha ding ua, saham vun in akhu khum ding ua, azawnna zawlte avaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh puondum khat ala ding ua, khuoilu meivah tunna leh khuna a a zah ding uh meivahte leh ataitete, avutluohnate leh Olive sathau buhte zousie akhu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh tamte leh avanzah zousie khuna saham vun a tuom in tuakhu azawnna zawltungah akhang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh sana maitam tungah Puondum apha ding ua, saham vunin akhu ding ua, azawlte aguonglut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh mun siengthoua a nasepna a vanzah umlebelte zousie khu ala sieng ding ua, Puon dum in atun ding ua, saham vunin akhu ding uhi, tualeh azawnna ding zawl tungah akikhang chiet ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh maitam a pat in vutte aluohdoh ding ua, atungah puonsan au apha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh atungah a nasepna vanzah uh umlebelte zousie, mei lahnate, sathuana siakhutkate, vut luohnate, tuikuongte leh maitam umlebelte zousie akoi ding ua, tualeh akhuna saham vun in akhu ding ua, azawnna zawl avaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Aaron leh atapaten, mun siengthou leh mun siengthou umlebelte zousie akhu zou chieng ua, giehphuol akisuon ding chiengun, Kohath tapate azawng dingin ang kisa zel ding ua, hinanleh sil siengthou bangma akhoi sih ding uhi; Tuachilouin ashi kha ding uhi. Tamte khu kimutuona biehbuh a Kohath tapate nasep dingte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tualeh siempu Aaron tapa Eleazar nasep ding khu thaumei dette, gimnamtui halte leh nichin kitatlou a tanghou sillatte leh sathau nu dingte, biehbuh leh asunga um zousie, mun siengthou leh tuana asunga umlebelte zousie a etkol ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi leh Aaron ahoupi a, akung uah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kohath tate phung khu Levi namte lah a kipat satkhe mai sinlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh silsiengthou pente ava nai chieng ua, shi lou a ahin theina dingun, tambangin bawl un; Aaron leh atapate ava lut ding ua, michin anasep ding u’leh a mawpuohna uh ana guot pieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh sil siengthoute akikhu laiin a en dinga alut ding uh ahi sih, alut u’leh ashi ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Gershon tate aphung aphung u’leh ahainet ahainet in sim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum sawm thum apat kum sawmnga tandong kimutuona biehbuh sunga lut a nasem thei dingte zousie sim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gershon tate mawpuoh ding khu nasep leh vanpuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amauten biehbuh puonzahte leh kimutuona biehbuh leh akhunate, atung khuna saham vunte leh kimutuona biehbuh kotkhah puonzahte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahuongsung imna puonzahte, biehbuh kunga um maitam leh akimvel huongsung imna kotpi puonzahte leh khaute, tualeh anasepna vanzah zousiete apo ding ua, bawl ding poimaw zousie abawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aaron leh atapate thuhil dungzuiin Gershon taten nna asem ding ua, vante zong apo ding uhi, tualeh avanpuoh ding zousie hil dingin mi na guotpieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tamte khu kimutuona biehbuh a Gershon tate nasep ding ahi. Amaute tunga thuneina khu Siempu Aaron tapa Ithamar khut nuoi ah a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Merari tapate aphung aphung leh ahainet ahainet un nasim ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kum sawm thum apat atunglam kum sawm nga a upa tan chieng, kimutuona biehbuh a nasem dinga lut thei zousie na sim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh kimutuona biehbuh a anasep uh, a mawpuoh na ding uh tamte ahi, biehbuh singpeh te, azawlte, akhuomte leh akingahna khuohkuohte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahuong kimvel a khuomte, angahna khuohkuohte, akilnate, akhaute, vanzah zousie leh vanzah dang dang puoh ding; amin uh lou chietin apuoh ding uh na guot pieh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tamte Siempu Aaron tapa Ithamar khut nuoi a kimutuona biehbuha Merari tapate hahlesuonten abawl ding uh dungzui a asep ding uh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi leh Aaron tualeh mipi kikhawm lamkaiten, Kohath tapate a phung aphung u’leh ahainet ahainet in asim ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kum sawm thum apat atunglam kum sawmnga tan chieng, kimutuona biehbuh a nasem dinga lut thei zousie asim ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aphung leh ahainet dungzui ua asim doh teng uh tul ni leh za sagi leh sawmnga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tamte khu ahi, kimutuona biehbuh a nasem theiding Kohath hahlesuonte asimte uh, Mosi zanga Mangpa thupieh dungzui a Mosi leh Aaron in asimte uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Gershon tapate aphung aphung u’leh ahainet ahainet ua kisimte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kum sawm thum apat atunglam kum sawm nga tan dong, kimutuona biehbuh a nasem dinga lut thei zousiete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aphung aphung u’leh ahainet ahainet ua kisimte tul ni leh zaguh leh sawmthum ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tamte khu Mangpa thupieh dungzui a, Mosi leh Aaron in asimte uh, kimutuona biehbuh a nasem thei ding Gershon tate hah lesuonte asimte uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh Merari tapate aphung aphung u’leh ahainet ahainet ua kisimte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Kum sawm thum apat atunglam kum sawm nga tan chieng, kimutuona biehbuh a nasem dinga lut thei zousiete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Aphung u’leh ahainet ua kisim teng tul thum leh zani ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tamte khu Mangpa’n Mosi tungtawna athupieh dungzuia Mosi leh Aaron in Merari tapate hahle suonte asimte uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh Levimite aphung aphung u’leh ahainet ahainet ua, Mosi leh Aaron leh Israel lamkaiten asimte uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kum sawm thum apat atunglam kum sawmnga tanchieng, kimutuona biehbuha nasem dinga lut thei zousie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Akisim zousie tul giet leh zanga leh sawm giet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mangpa’n Mosi zanga athupieh dungzuiin michin anasep ding dungzui leh avan puoh ding dungzui a sim ahi ua, tuachimabangin Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin asim ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel tate lah a pha zousie leh siluonga kisubua zousie giehphuol pulam a koidoh dingin thu pie in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasal hi’n numei hitaleh giehphuol pulam ah na koi ding ahi, alah ua ka tenna agiehphuol uh a suhbua lou na dingun,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten tuabangin abawl ua, amaute giehphuol pulam ah akoidoh ua, Mangpa’n Mosi kunga agen bangin Israel taten abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Israel tate kungah gen in, Pasal ahiei numei ahiei in, Mangpa tungah sil bawlkhiel in siemlou tang ta leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abawl khelna zieh ua thupha a tawi ding uh ahi: tualeh abawlkhel man uh kimtahin adin ding uhi. Tualeh Se nga suo sekhat abelap dinga, abawl khelna pa ape ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh bawlkhelman sang dingpa’n, sanggam kinaipi anei sih leh bawlkhel man khu Mangpa a dingin siempu kunga pieh ahi dinga; kilemna belamtal chilou zong ama a dingin kilemna akibawlpiehding a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten sil siengthou lat ding siempu kunga ahing tawi pouma uh, alantu siempuin atang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Michin asillat siengthoute ama a ahidinga, siempu kunga apieh pouma siempu a ahi ding,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel tate kungah gen inlen, akung uah mi a zi vahthap a ginumloutah a agamtat a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Midangin a luppi a hinanleh, apasal in a theilou a, aguh a bawl ahi a, hinanleh amanu suhbua a um a, amanu tunga theipitu lah umlou a, angkawm ahi kipuong zong hilou koiman lah man lou a aum a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh apasal in ginlelna lungsim nei in azinu thangsiet na toh aginlel bangin na zawntat taleh, ahisihleh azi zawntat loupi a aginlel teitei leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabang thu ah apasal in azi siempu kungah ahing zawpi dinga, amanu sillat dingin barli bu ephah se sawmsuo sekhat ahing tawi ding a tua sillatte tung ah sathau leh gimnamtui a sung sih ding hi; a ziehpen gitlouna kithei dohna ding leh thangsietna sillat theizingna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tualeh siempuin amanu ahing pui nai ding a, Mangpa masangah ading sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin leibel in tui siengthou a hing tawi dinga, tualeh biehbuh tuol a leivui siempuin ala dinga tui lah ah akoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin numei khu Mangpa masangah ading sah dinga, numei nu’n asam ahamkhe sah dinga, theizingna sillat leh thangsietna sillat khu amanu khut sungah akoi dinga, tualeh siempuin akhut ah hamselawna tuikha atawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin amanu akichiemsah dinga, Numeinu kungah, Pasal koima na luppi lou a, na pasal chilou midang koima toh kisubua dinga na thangvah loua ahileh tami hamse tungsah tuikha apat siengthou tain;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh na pasal chilou midang toh angkawm a na kisuhbua a, na pasal chilou koi ahiei in ahing luppi leh vang na siengthou sih ding hi; achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempuin numei khu gausapna kihahsielna a neisah dinga, siempuin numeinu kungah Mangpa’n na pheipi hing muot sah henlen, nagilpi hing puohsah henlen, Mangpa’n na mite lahah hamse thuoh in hing bawl ta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh tam gausapna tangtungsah tui khu na gilpi puohsah dingin leh na pheipi muotsah dingin, na gil sungah alut ding hi achi ding hi, tualeh numei nu’n Amen, amen achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tualeh siempuin tam hamsietna thute zousie laibu sungah agiel dinga, tuikha in anuoimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin numeinu’n hamsietna tangtungsah tuikha khu adawn sah dinga, hamsietna tangtungsah tuikha khu asungah alut dinga ahing kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin ginlelna ann sillat khu, numeinu khut apat ala dinga, tangbuong sillat khu Mangpa masangah avei dinga, maitam tungah alan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin ann sillat theizingna khu sip dim khat aham dinga, maitam tungah ahal ding hi, tuazouchiengin tua tui khu numeinu adawn sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh numeinu’n tui adawn sah zou chiengin, hichi ahing hiding hi, suhbua aum ahia, apasal tunga sil abawlkhel leh hamsietna tang tungsah tui agil sung ah alut dinga, ahing kha dinga, tualeh agilpi ahing puoh dinga, apheipi ahing muot dinga, numeinu khu amite lah a hamsethuoh ahing hita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh numeinu khu suhbuo ahilou a, asienthou leh azalen dinga, ta leh nau anei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tam dan khu numei thapvah, apasal hilou midang ang a akisuh bua chienga ginmawna dan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahisihleh pasal in azi ginmawna lungsim ahing nei chienga, numei Mangpa masanga adin sah hunchiengin siempuin tam dan zousie a tungah abawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n pasal pen gitlouna akipat asieng dinga, numei in agitlouna akipuoh ding hi,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel tate kungah thu gen inlen, akung uah, Pasal ahiei, numei ahiei in, Mangpa dinga kituom koi dinga, Nazir mi hina dinga kichiemna anei lai un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zu leh zu chia apat akituom koi ding ahi, grep zu leh grep zu chia zong adawn ding ahisih, greptui zong adawn sih dinga, grep ga vuoi leh agaw zong anesih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Akituomkoi sungsie grep guia kipata kibawl, atanga kipat ahaw tan dongin bangma ane sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kituomkoi dinga akichiem sungsie alutang leh sam heuna tem akithu khah louding ahi, Mangpa adinga akituomkoi hun achin masangsie ama pen asiengthou dinga, asam akhoi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mangpa adinga akituomkoi sungteng, shiluong kunga zong apei khah vawt lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Apa ahiei, anu ahiei, asanggampa ahiei asanggamnu ahiei shi ziehin zong akisu bua ding ahi sih hi; Pasian a dinga akikoi siengthouna alutunga um ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Akituomkoi sungsie Mangpa adinga siengthou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ama kunga mi thakhat a ashi a akikoisiengthouna lutang asuh bua tahleh, akisiensuo ni ani sagi niin alu aheu ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh ni giet niin, kimutuona biehbuh kotkha a, siempu kungah vakhu kopkhat ahiei, vapal nou khat ahiei ahing tawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siempuin, khat khelna thoina dingin alan dinga adangkhat pen halmang sillat in, mi shi zieha abawlkhelna ziehin kilemna abawl pieh dinga, tualeh tuani main alu asu siengthou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh akituom koina nite Mangpa masanga akoi siengthoukia na dingin belamnou atal kum khat a upa khat tatkhelna kithoina dingin ahing tawi ding hi; hinanleh akituom koina buasah ahitah ziehin amasanga nite bangmalou asuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tualeh Tamkhu Nazir miin akituomkoina nite abuchin chienga abawl ding dan ahi, ama pen kimutuona biehbuh ah kotkhabul ah akipui dinga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Belamnou tal kum khat a upa gensiet bei khat halmang sillat dingin, belamnou anu kum khat a upa, gensietbei khat khelna sillat dingin, belam tal gensiet bei khat, lemna sillat dingin alan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh tanghou tolsawlou leh sathau toh kihal tangbuonga kibawl tanghou beu leh sathau toh kimeh tolsawlou tanghou pheng law khat toh, a ann sillat u’leh adawn sillat uh alan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin tuate khu Mangpa masangah ahing tawi dinga, akhelna sillat leh ahalmang sillat alan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh belamtal khu law sunga um tolsawlou tanghou toh Mangpa kunga lemna sillat dingin alan dinga: siempuin a ann sillat leh dawn sillat zong alan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Nazir mipan kimutuona biehbuh kotphung ah, akituomkoina lu aheu dinga, akituomkoina lu a sam ala dinga, lemna sillat kithoina nei a um mei khuh a avah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin belamtal lieng kihuon min leh law sunga um tolsawlou tanghou beu khat leh tanghou pheng khat ala dinga, akituomkoina sam aheu zou chiengin Nazir mipa khut ah atawi sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin Mangpa masangah vei sillat ding in avei ding hi; tam pen siempu satan sil siengthou ahi ding hi, a awm vei sillat leh amal vei sillat toh. Tuazou chiengin Nazir mipa’n uoin adawn thei ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tamte Mangpa masanga Nazir mi kichiemna leh a sillat dan ahi, ama ut thua alat simlou in, akituomkoina kichiemna dan dungzuiin abawl ding ahi,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Aaron leh atapate kungah gen inlen tambangin Israel tate na guolzawl ding uh ahi, akung uah chiin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mangpa’n nang hing guolzawl henlen, hing kemta henlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mangpa’n a mel na tungah tangsah henlen, hing hepi zel ta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mangpa nanglam hing nga henlen, lungmuonna hing peta hen, chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tuachi’n amauten Israel tate tungah, Ka min atuongsah ding ua, tuachi’n ken amaute ka guol zawl ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in biehbuh adinsah zou diema, sathau anu zou a, asuhsiengthou zou a, avanzah zousie leh amaitam leh atuium abelsuon zousie sathau anu a, asuhsiengthou niin tam bang ahing hi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel lamkaite, a innkuon ua upa pente aphung chiet ua kisimte tunga anam lamkaite un sillat alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa masanga akithoina sillat uh sakolleng buhnei guh leh bawngtal sawmle ni ahing tawi ua, sakolleng khat lamkai ni zela dingin leh lamkai khat ading bawngtal khat chiet, biehbuh mai ah ahing tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kimutuona biehbuh a nasepna dingin tamte la inlen; Levite kungah anasepna dungzuiin na pe ding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in sakolleng buhneite leh bawngtalte ala a, Levite apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sakolleng ni leh bawngtal li Gershon tapate kungah anasep dan dungzui un apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh sakolleng li leh bawngtal giet, Merari tapate kungah anasep dan dungzui un, Siempu Aaron tapa Ithamar khutah apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Kohath tapate kungah bangma apesih hi, aziehpen munsiengthou nasep amaute mawpuohna ahia, vanzah dingte aliengkou ua apuoh zel uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n lamkaite’n sathau kinu niin maitam kisiensuona dingin sillatte alan ua, asillatte uh maitam masangah alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi kungah “Lamkai chinin, maitam siensuona dinga a sillatte uh nichin akizomzel in alan ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anikhat nia sillat lan dinga hing tawi khu Juda phunga Amminadab tapa Nahshon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asillat khu dangkasia kuong khat, agih dan shekel za leh sawm thum, mun siengthou a shekel tedan a, shekel sawm sagi toh kikim agih dangkasia heng kuong khat, ann sillat dingin sathau toh kihal tangbuong nel ngingei khum heng kuong dim tuoh ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gimnamtui shekel sawm toh kikim a gih, sana tawkeu dim khat:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtal nou khat, belamtal khat, kum khat a upa belam nou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kelnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh lemna kithoina sillat dingin bawngtal ni, belamtal nga, keltal nga, kum khat a upa belamnou nga: tamte Amminadab tapa Nahshon sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani ni niin Issakar phung lamkai Zuar tapa Nathaneel in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman a sillat dingin mun siengthou shekel tena bangin, shekal za leh sawmthuma gih, dangka sia kuong khat leh shekel sawm sagi agih, dangka sia hengkuong khat alan a, ann sillat dingin sathau toh kihal tangbuong nel ngingei heng kuongte gel dim tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Shekel sawm toh kikim a gih, gimnamtui sana tawkeu dim khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtalnou khat, belamtal khat kum khat a upa belamnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kelnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh lemna sillat dingin bawngtal ni, belam tal nga, keltal nga, kum khat a upa belamnou nga; tamte Zuar tapa Nathaneel sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani thum ni’n Zebulun tate lamkai Helon tapa Eliab in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A sillatte khu mun siengthoua shekel tena bangin, shekel za leh sawmthum a gih, dangka sia kuong khat leh shekel sawmsagi a gih dangka sia hengkuong khat alan a, ann sillat dingin sathautoh kihal, tangbuong nel ngingei hengkuongte gel dim tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Shekel sawm toh kikim a gih, gim namtui sana tawkeu dim khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtal nou khat, kum khat a upa belamnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kelnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh lemna sillat dingin, bawngtal ni, belam tal nga, keltal nga, kum khat a upa belamnou nga, tamte Helon tapa Eliab sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ni li niin Reuben tate lamkai Shedeur tapa Elizur in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A sillat khu mun siengthou a shekel tena bangin, shekel zale-sawmthum a gih, dangka sia kuong khat, shekel sawm sagi agih dangkasia hengkuong khat alan a, ann sillat dingin, sathau toh kihal tangbuong nel ngi ngei hengkuongte gel dim tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Shekel sawm toh kikim a gih, gimnamtui sana tawkeu dim khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtal nou khat, belamtal khat kum khat a upa belamnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kelnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh lemna sillat dingin bawngtal ni, belamtal nga, keltal nga, kum khat a upa belamnou nga, tamte Shedeur tapa Elizur sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ni nga niin Simeon tate lamkai Zurishaddai tapa Shelumiel in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A sillat khu mun siengthou a shekel tena bangin, shekel za leh sawmthum a gih dangka sia kuong khat, shekel sawmsagi a gih dangka sia hengkuong khat alan a, ann sillat dingin, sathau toh kihal tangbuong nel ngi ngei hengkuongte gel dim tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Shekel sawm toh kikim a gih gimnamtui sana tawkeu dim khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtal nou khat, belamtal khat, kum khat a upa belamnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kelnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Lemna sillat dingin bawngtal ni, belamtal nga; keltal nga, kumkhat a upa belamnou nga, tamte Zurishaddai tapa Shelumiel sillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ni guh niin Gad tate lamkai Deuel tapa Eliasaph in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A sillat khu mun siengthou a shekel tena bangin shekel za leh sawmthum a gih dangka sia kuong khat shekel sawm sagi a gih dangka sia hengkuong khat alan a; ann sillat dingin sathau toh kihal tangbuong nel ngi ngei hengkuongte gel dim tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Shekel sawm toh kikim a gih gimnamtui sana tawkeu dim khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtal nou khat, belamtal khat kum khat a upa belamnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kelnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh lemna sillat dingin bawngtal ni, belamtal nga, keltal nga, kum khat a upa belamnou nga, tamte Deuel tapa Eliasaph sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ni sagi niin Ephraim tate lamkai Ammihud tapa Elishama in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A sillat khu mun siengthoua shekel tena bangin shekel za leh-sawm thum a gih dangkasia kuong khat, shekel sawm sagi a gih dangka sia hengkuong khat alan a; ann sillat dingin sathau toh kihal tangbuong nel ngi ngei hengkuongtegel dim tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Shekel sawm toh kikim a gih gimnamtui sana tawkeu dim khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtalnou khat, belamtal khat; kum khat a upa belamnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kel nou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tualeh lemna sillat dingin bawngtal ni, belamtal nga, keltal nga, kum khat a upa belamnou nga, tamte Ammihud tapa Elishama sillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ani giet niin Manasseh tate lamkai Pedahzur tapa Gamaliel in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />A sillat khu mun siengthoua shekel tena bangin shekel za leh sawmthum a gih, dangka sia kuong khat leh shekel sawm sagi a gih dangka-sia hengkuong khat, alan a; ann sillat dingin sathau toh kihal tangbuong nel ngi ngei hengkuongte gel dim tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Shekel sawm toh kikim a gih gimnamtui sana tawkeu dimkhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtal nou khat, belamtal khat, kum khat a upa belamnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kelnou khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tualeh lemna sillat dingin bawngtal ni, belamtal nga, keltal nga, kum khat a upa belamnou nga: tamte Pedahzur tapa Gamaliel sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ni kuo niin, Benjaminte lamkai Gideon tapa Abidan in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />A sillat khu mun siengthou a, shekel tena bang in shekel za leh sawmthum a gih, dangka sia kuong khat leh shekel sawm sagi a gih dangka sia heng kuong khat alan a; ann sillat dingin sathau toh kihal, tangbuong nel ngi ngei hengkuong tegel dim tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Shekel sawm toh kikim a gih gimnamtui sana tawkeu dim khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtal nou khat, belam tal khat, kum khat a upa belam nou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kelnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tualeh lemna sillat dingin bawngtal ni, belam tal nga, keltal nga, kum khat a upa belamnou nga; tamte Gideon tapa Abidan sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Ani sawmni in Dan tate lamkai Ammishaddai tapa Ahiezer in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />A sillat khu mun siengthou a shekel tena bangin shekel za leh sawmthum a gih, dangka sia kuong khat leh shekel sawm sagi a gih dangka sia heng kuong khat alan a; tangbuong sillat dingin, sathau toh kihal tangbuong nel ngi ngei hengkuongte gel dim tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Shekel sawm toh kikim agih gimnamtui sana tawkeu dimkhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtal nou khat, belamtal khat, kum khat a upa belamnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kelnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Tualeh lemna sillat dingin bawngtal ni, belamtal nga, Keltal nga, kum khat a upa belamnou nga; tamte Ammishaddai tapa Ahiezer sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Ni sawm leh khat niin Asher tate lamkai Okran tapa Pagiel in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />A sillat khu mun siengthoua shekel tena bangin shekel za leh sawmthum a gih dangka sia kuong khat leh shekel sawm sagi a gih dangka sia hengkuong khat alan a, ann sillat dingin sathau toh kihal, tangbuong nel ngi ngei hengkuong tegel dim tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Shekel sawm toh kikim a gih gim namtui sana tawkeu dim khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtal nou khat, belamtal khat, kum khat a upa belamnou khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kelnou khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Tualeh lemna sillat dingin bawngtal ni, belamtal nga, keltal nga, kum khat a upa belamnou nga; tamte Okran tapa Pagiel sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Nisawm leh nini niin Naphtali tate lamkai Enan tapa Ahira in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />A sillat khu mun siengthou a shekel tena bangin shekel za leh sawmthum a gih dangka sia kuong khat leh shekel sawm sagi a gih dangka sia hengkuong khat alan a; ann sillat dingin, sathau toh kihal, tangbuong nel ngi ngei hengkuong tegel dim tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Shekel sawm toh kikim a gih gimnamtui, sana tawkeu dim khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Halmang sillat dingin, bawngtal nou khat, belam tal khat, kum khat a upa belam nou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="82" style="v" />Khelna sillat dingin kelnou khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="83" style="v" />Tualeh lemna sillat dingin bawngtal ni, belamtal nga, keltal nga, kum khat a upa belamnou nga: tamte Enan tapa Ahira sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />Maitam sathau anu ni ua, Israel lamkaite sillatte tamte ahi: Dangka sia kuong sawm leh ni, dangka sia hengkuong sawm leh ni, sana tawkeu sawm leh ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="85" style="v" />Dangka sia kuong khat shekel za leh sawmthum a gih; chiet, hengkuong shekel sawm sagi a gih chiet; dang ka sia kuong zousie aun in, mun siengthou shekel simdan bangin shekel tul ni leh zali a gih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" />Sana tawkeu sawm leh ni, gimnamtuia dim, mun siengthou shekel tena dan bangin shekel sawma gih chiet ahia; tawkeu a sana zousie aun in shekel za leh sawmni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="87" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding bawngtal zousie a un in sawm leh ni ahia, belamtal sawm leh ni, belamnou kum khat a upa sawm leh ni, tualeh khelna sillat ding kelnou sawm leh ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="88" style="v" />Tualeh lemna kithoina sillat ding bawngtal sawmni leh li, belamtal sawm guh, keltal sawmguh, tualeh belamnou kum khat a upa sawmguh, Tamte maitam sathau kinu zoua akisiensuona sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi, Pasian be dinga kimutuona biehbuh sunga alut leh Cherubimte gel kikaal a, hepina thuhun bawm tunga um hepina toupha akipat in ama hing houpi aw khat aza a, tuachi’n aman zong ahoupi ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Aaron kungah thu gen inlen, akungah meivahte nadet chiengin, meivah sagiten thau mei tunna mailam asalvah ding uh ahi,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Aaron in khumbangin abawl a; Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin thaumei koina mailam atanvah thei na dingin thaumeite ade kuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh tam thaumei tunna kibawl dan khu, sana a kikheng ahia, atunna kungpi apat apapete tan a kikheng ahi: Mangpa’n alim Mosi amusah bangbang in thaumei tunna abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Israel tate lah a kipat in Levite atuomin khen inlen susiengthouin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute suhsiengthouna dingin tambangin bawl in; atung uah suhsiengna tui the inlen, asa tung zousie ua amul uh heusiengsah inlen; apuonte uh sawp sah inlen, kisusiengsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n bawngtalnou khat leh ann sillat tangbuong nel sathau toh kihal lasah inlen, tualeh khelna sillat dingin bawngtalnou dang khat zong na lah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh kimutuona biehbuh maiah nang zawpi dinga; Israel tate zousie na kikhawm sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Levite Mangpa masangah na hing zawpi ding a; Israel taten Levite tungah akhut uh angam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aaron in Levite khu Mangpa nna asep thei na dingun, Israel tate a dingin vei sillat in Mangpa masangah a lan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Leviten akhut uh bawngtal lutungah angam ding ua, Levite dinga kilemna bawlna dingin; bawngtal khat khelna sillat dingin, tualeh adang khat pen halmang sillat dingin Mangpa kungah alanding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Levite khu Aaron leh atapate masangah na umsah dinga, Mangpa kungah amaute vei sillat in na lan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuachibangin Levite khu Israel tate lah a pat in na khentuom ding a; tuachi’n Levite khu kei a ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuazouchiengin Levite khu kimutuona biehbuh a nasep sem dingin alut ding ua, tualeh nangman amaute na susieng dinga, vei sillat in amaute na lan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel tate lah a kipat keima dinga hing kipe siengthou ahita uhi, Israel tate lah a tachil naubu hong masa pen zousie taangin keima dingin amaute ka kilah ahi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel tate lah a tachil pieng masa zousie mihing hiin ganta hitaleh keima a ahi uhi; Izipt gam a tachil piengmasa zousie ka thalup lai a, amaute Kei a dinga ka suhsiengthou ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate lah a kipat in tachil pieng masa zousie tangin Levite khu kala ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Keima’n Levite khu, Israel tate lah apat in, Aaron leh atapate kunga, kimutuona biehbuh a Israel taten a seppieh ding leh Israel tate munsiengthoua ahing pei chieng ua Israel tate lah a natna hii alen louna dinga lemna kithoina bawl pieh dingin ka peta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuabangin Mosi leh Aaron tualeh Israel mipi kikhawmte zousiein, Mangpa’n Mosi kunga Levite tungtanga thu apieh zousie dungzuiin Levite tungah abawl ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levite akisusiengthou ua, apuonte uh a sawp uhi; tualeh Aaron in amaute khu sillat bang in Mangpa masangah alan a; Aaron in amaute suhsiengna dingin kilemna abawl pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuazouin Levite khu kimutuona biehbuh ah Mangpa nasep semdingin Aaron leh atapate masangah alut ta uhi. Mangpa’n Mosi kunga Levite tungtanga thu apieh dungzuiin amauten atung uah abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akung ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Levite tanvou khu tambang ahi; kum sawmni leh nga apat atunglam tengin kimutuona biehbuh nasep sem dingin alut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh kum sawmnga a upaten nasepna akhawlsan ding ua, nna asem nawnsih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh kimutuona biehbuh kep thu ah a unaute uh apanpi ding ua, nasep pen asem nawn sih ding uhi. Tuabangin Levite nasep ding na guot pieh ding ahi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Izipt gam apat ahing peidoh nua uh akum nina aha khatna ah, Sinai gam dai ah Mosi ahoupi a, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel taten peikan pawi ahunbi guot ah neizel uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tami ha ni sawmleh li ni nitahlam ahunbi guot ah na zang ding ua, abawl ding dan zousie dungzui leh atat dan ding kiguot dungzuiin tam pawi na mang ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Israel tate Peikan pawi aman ding uh ahi chi’n ahil ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh amauten hakhatna ni sawm leh li ni, nitah lamin Sinai gamdai ah peikan pawi abawl uhi. Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin Israel taten abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh mi koite ahiei mishi luong zieha kibuasah a um ua, tua ni in peikan pawi abawl thei tasih ua, tualeh amaute Mosi leh Aaron masangah ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua miten akungah “Tam bangin agen uhi, mishi luong zieh in kaki buasah khata uhi. Tuazieh in Israel tate lah a ahunbi guota Mangpa kunga sillat lan theilou dinga, bang dinga kham ka hi uoi?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mosi in akung uah, “Hing na ngahta di un, na tung thu uah Mangpa’n bang thupieh ang pie ei mah hing ngaikhe ta di vang” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Israel tate kungah thu gen inlen, nalah u’leh nahah nasuonte lah ua mi koipou mishi luong zieha ahing sienthou taahsih u’leh zong ahisihleh khuolgamlapi ah zinmang leh zong, Mangpa adingin peikan pawi amang thei veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ha nina ni sawm leh li ni, nitah lam in tam pawi a mang ding ua, tolsawlou tanghou toh anntekha aneh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zingmawng dongin avaal bangma a nuasie sih ding ua, agu khat zong na sutan sih ding uhi; Peikan pawi bawl ding dan zousie dungzuiin, na mangding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh siengthou napi a, khuol zin zong hilou a peikan pawi aman nuom sihleh tua mipa khu amite lah a pat satkhieh ahi ding hi, Mangpa adinga sillat ahunbi guota ahing tawilou ziehin, tua mipan ama khelna maw akipuoh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh gamdang mi na lah ua teng a uma, Mangpa dinga Peikan pawi aman ding leh Peikan pawi man dan dinga thu guot dungzui leh tawndan dungzuiin abawlding hi: gamdang mileh gam sunga pieng mi a dingin dan kibang khat na nei ding ahi,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh biehbuh lam zou niin, biehbuh khu meilum in atuom a, nitah lamin biehbuh tungah meikuong bang bang khat zingmawng dongin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachibangin a um den a, sun in meilumin atuom a, zanin meikuongin akilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh biehbuh akipat a meilum lahtou ahi chiengin Israel tate aki pandoh zel uhi. Tualeh meilum akhawlna mun pouma ah Israel taten giehphuol asat ua apuon inn uh azah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa’n thu apieh chiengin Israel tate apeidoh zel ua, Mangpa thupiehin giehphuol asat zel uhi, biehbuh tunga meilum a um laisie apuon innte uah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh biehbuh tunga meilum nitampi a um leh Israel taten Mangpa thupieh amang ua, apeidoh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khatveivei meilum khu puonbuh tungah tomnou khat teng a um zela, tuachi’n Mangpa thupieh bangin akhawl ua, Mangpa thupieh bangin a peidoh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahi a, khatvei vei meilum nitah lam apat zingmawng dong a um a, tualeh meilum tung lam a akikhaisang tou chiengin apei zel uhi; sun hiin zan hileh meilum khu tunglam a akikhai sang tou hun hunin apei zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahisihleh meilum khu biehbuh tunga ni ni ahiei, ha khat ahiei, kum khat ahiei a uma, tuabanga a um den leh Israel tate a puon innte uah a um ua apeidoh sih uhi; hinanleh akikhaisang chiengin a pei zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mangpa thupiehin apuon inn uah a um ua, Mangpa thupieh ma bangin apei zel uhi, Mosi zanga Mangpa thupieh bangin amauten Mangpa thu amang uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Dangkasia pengkul ni bawl inlen, sehta a khenthaw in bawl in, mipite hatkhawmna ding leh giehphuol kisuon dohna dinga na zah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuate gel a mut khawm chiengun mipite zousie na kungah kimutuona biehbuh kot phungah ahing kikhop ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh pengkul khat maimai amut u’leh, Israel phung lamkaite zousie na kungah ahing kikhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh kigalginna pengkul na mut chiengun giehphuol suolam panga umte apawt khe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh kigalginna pengkul ni veina na mut chiengun, simlam panga umte a potkhe ding uhi; apawtdoh ding chiengun galzauna patau pengkul mut bangin amut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh mipite kikhop khawm na dingin pengkul na mut ding ua, hinanleh Patau pengkul mut banga na mut lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tueleh Aaron tapate siemputen pengkulte amut ding ua, tuate nou a dingin na khang tungtawn ua nahah nasuonte uh donga dan thupieh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na gamsung ua, nou hing nuoisie melmate dou dinga na kuon chiengun, Patau Pengkul na mut ding ua, tuachi’n Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah theidoh in na um ding ua, na melmate ua pat hundamin na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh nuom nasah nite u’leh ahun chiem nei a na pawi bawl chiengun, na ha tha chiengun tualeh na halmang sillatte u’leh na lemna kithoina sillatte uah pengkul na mut ding uh ahi: tuachi’n na Pasian uh masangah nou adingin thei ngitngetna ahi ding: Kei Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh kum nina, ha nina, ni sawmni niin hichi ahing hia, thiepina biehbuh apat meilum khu akikhaisang touta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate Sinai gamdai akipat in apeidoh ta ua, meilum khu Paran gamdai ah akhawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi zanga Mangpa thupieh bangin apei masa phot uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amasapenin Juda pawlte aphung chiemtena uh tawi in apawl pawl in apawt ua, alamkaipa uh Amminadab tapa Nahshon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Issakar tate phung lamkaipa khu Zuar tapa Nathana-el ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Zebulun tate phung lamkaipa khu Helon tapa Eliab ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh biehbuh khu aphel ua, Gershon tapate leh Merari tapate biehbuh puo a pangte khu akipandoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Reuben pawlte aphung chiemtena uh tawiin apawl pawl in apawt ua, alamkaipa uh Shedeur tapa Elizur ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Simeon tate phung lamkaipa khu Zurishaddai tapa Shelumiel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Gad tate phung lamkaipa khu Deuel tapa Eliasaph ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Kohath miten munsiengthou vante puoin akipan doh ua, tualeh adangten amauh hing tun tah in biehbuh atung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Ephraim pawlte aphung chiemtena uh tawiin apawl pawl in apawt ua, alam kaipa ukhu Ammihud tapa Elishama ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Manasseh tate phung lamkaipa khu Pedahzur tapa Gamaliel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Benjamin tate phung lamkaipa khu Gideon tapa Abidan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuazouin Dan tate giehphuol akipat aphung chiemtena uh tawi in apawl pawl in ahing pawt ua, amaute khu apawl nukhia pente ahi ta uhi, alamkaipa ukhu Ammishaddai tapa Ahiezer ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Asher tate phung lamkaipa khu Okran tapa Pagiel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Naphtali tate phung lamkaipa khu Enan tapa Ahira ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tambangin ahi Israel tate amaute phung chiemtena tawidan dungzui a apawtdoh lai ua apeidan uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuin Mosi in asungpa Midian mi Reuel tapa Hobab kungah “Mangpa’n ka hing peding achina muna pei ding ka hi ua, ka kung uah hing pei inlen, na tungah hoitahin ka hing bawl ding ua, Mangpa’n Israelte tungtang hoitah a agen tah zieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tualeh aman hing pei da konvang, hinanleh ka gam lam leh ka sanggamte kungah ka peizaw ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in akungah, “Hing peisan sin, ka hing ngen ahi, gamdai ah giehphuol satna mun ding na thei zaw a, kou a dingin mit na hing hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi dinga, ka kung ua nang peileh hichi ahiding, Mangpa’n ka tung ua silhoi abawl pouma, kou zong na tungah ka bawl ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa muol a kipat ni thum lamah apeita uhi: Ama ua dinga kingahna mun lemtang sui a ni thum lam a apei lai un, Mangpa thuhun bawm khu amasang uah a pei zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh giehphuol a kipat apawtdoh chiengun Mangpa meilum khu sun chiengin atung uah a um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Thuhun bawm akipatdoh pouma chiengin, Mosi’n “Mangpa aw hing thoudoh inlen, na melmate kithezah sah inlen, tualeh Nang hing mudate na masangah taizahta uhen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh aki ngah pouma chiengin aman “Aw Mangpa, Israel mi sangtampite kung ah hing kile kia in” achi zel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh mipite ahing phunta ua, tuabanga aphunnate un Mangpa akipah sah sih a, tua khu Mangpa’n azata a, tuachi’n alung thahna ahing kuongdohta a, giehphuol tawplam ninga umte akatum ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite Mosi kungah akikou ua tualeh Mosi’n Mangpa kungah thu angen a, meikuong ahing mitta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman tua mun min khu Taberah achi ta hi, Mangpa mei alah ua akuon ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh alah ua namdang toh kitengpolten sa lunggulna ahing nei ta ua, Israel tate zong akap kiata ua, “Koi ahiei ineh ding sa hing pe ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ut uta Izipt gam a ngasa inehte ithei zinga, tangmaite, dawnkhawte, louthul pumte, louthul sielnehte louthul kaangte zong man bei in ine uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin vang ihinna uh agaw gawpta a, imitmu uah manna chilou kinepna ding bangma aum non sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manna pen Koriander tang bang ahia, amel lat dan in tuikepsuong bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n miten atomkhawm ua, gawt guoina ah agawt ua, sum sungah asu guoi ua, bel sungah a huon ua, tanghouphengin abawl uhi, ineh leh sathau a kikang tanghou bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh zan lai a giehphuol a daitui akieh chiengin manna toh ahing kekhawm zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite a innkuon kuon un apuon inn kotzung chiet ua akaa uh Mosi in azata a, tualeh Mangpa lungthahna khu nasatahin ahing kuongkhe ta a, Mosi zong alungkim tasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Mangpa kungah “Bang dinga na suohpa nang hichi bawl genthei ahiei mah? Bangdinga na mitmu a deisahna tanglou a, tam mipite puohgih ka tunga na ngah ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam mipite zousie ka gil sunga nau vop banga ka vop ahiei mah? Apu leh pate kunga pieh dinga na chiem gam a puilut dingin, naudon mi’n nau nawitep lai apom bangin na angsungah pomin nang chi dinga ka hinkhiet nasa amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Heisung sa ka lah a, mipi hiza zouzai ka pieh ding ahiei mah? Amauten lah ka kungah kapkawm in ka neh ding uh sa hing pie’n chiin a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam mipi zousiete keima tangin ka paw zou sih hi, Kei a dingin agih taluo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hichibanga nang bawl ding ahileh hepitah in hing that vanglah mai inlen, na mitmu a deisahna ka tan leh tambanga ka gentheina hing musah nawn da mai in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi kungah, “Israel upate leh mipite upa, tualeh atung ua lamkai hi a na theite mi sawmsagi ka kungah hing hankhawm inlen, kimutuona biehbuh ah hing zawpi inlen nangma toh hing dingkhawm ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka hing kumsuh dinga, nang ka hing houpi ding hi: na tunga um hagau khu kala dinga amauh tungah ka koi ding hi; nangma tanga na puohlou na dingin, mipite puohgih khu nang toh apokhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh mipite kungah hichi’n gen in, zing chienga dingin kisusiengthou unlen, sa neding na hita uhi, Mangpa zahin, “Koi ahiei sa hing pe ding? Izipt gam a nuom isahsah utoh chia na kaa tahziehun, Mangpa’n sa ahing pe ding a na ne ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nikhat ahiei, ni ni sungbep ahiei, ni nga sung bep ahiei, ni sawm sungbep ahisih leh ni sawmni sung bep na ne sih ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh hakhat sung ving veng, na nahkohom ua, ahing pawtdoh a, nou a dinga luohsuoh huoi ahing himasang sie na ne ding uhi; Na lah ua um Mangpa khu na huot ua, “Bang dinga Izipt gam a kipat hing pawtdoh ita diei, chia amasanga na kaa zieh un; na chi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in, “Alah ua ka umna mipite kenga peithei tul zaguh tah ahi ua; tualeh nangman, ha khat sung pumpi aneh dingun sa pevang na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Belam nou leh ganhonte thapieh nanlei zong akham ding uh amah? Ahisihleh tuipi sunga nga um zousie man khawm nanlei akiching ding adiei?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi kungah, “Mangpa khut suh toma umta ahiei mah? Na tungah ka thu atun leh tunlou tuin na mu ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi apeidoh a, Mangpa thugen khu mipite ava hil a, tualeh mipite upa sawm sagite ahankhawm a, biehbuh kimvel ah ading sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa meilum in ahing kumsuh a, ama ahoupita hi; tualeh atunga um hagau khu ala a, upa sawmsagite kungah apie a, tualeh hichi ahing hia, atung ua hagau ahing tun tahin thu agenta ua, hinanleh hun sawtpi aki kou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh giehphuol ah mi ni a um nalai ua, khat min Eldad ahia, adang pen min Medad ahi; tualeh atung uah hagau atungta a, amaute khu min kigielte lah a tel ahi ua, hinanleh biehbuh ah ava pei sih ua, giehphuol ah thu aphuong denta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh tangval khat ava tai a, Mosi kung ah “Eldad leh Medad in giehphuol sungah thu a phuong phuong mai uhi” chi’n ava hil ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nun tapa Joshua akhangdawn lai a kipat a Mosi nasempa’n adawnga “Pu Mosi amaute kham mai ve” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in akungah “Kei zieha na thangsiet ahiei mah? Mangpa mite zousie guolnei hi sieng uhenlen, Mangpa’n ahagau atung uah koi chiet leh ichi hibang laitah a,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi leh Israel upate giehphuol lam ah ahing kinuale ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa kunga kipat in hui ahing langa tuipi lam a pat in vamim ahing taw a, giehphuol langkhat lampang ni khat lam leh a lelampang ni khat lam leh giehphuol kimvel daap suoh in, leitunga pat tong ni vel a sangin akesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh mipiten khum ni sunnitum leh zankhovah leh azingni sunnitum in vamimte ava tomkhawm ua, atomkhawm tawm pen in zong homer sawm atom ua tuate khu giehphuol kimvel ah aphou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh asa nehte uh akam sung ua aum lai in, Mangpa lungthahna khu mipite tungah akuongdoh ta a, tuachi’n mipite khu Mangpa’n natpi huoise tah in agawtta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaziehin tua mun khu Kibroth-hattavah achita hi, tuamun a sadu a gongsante avui tah zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh mipite Kibroth-hattava akipat in Hazeroth ah apei ua, Hazeroth ah aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Miriam leh Aaron in Ethiopia numei akiten pi zieh in Mosi agensie ua, Ethiopia numei akitenpi ngut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh amautegel in “Mosi kung guoh ah ahiei mah Mangpa’n thu agen tuom?” Eite kungah zong thu agen sih amah? Achi ua, Mangpa’n tua khu azata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi khu leitunga mi zousie lah a nunnem pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n, Mosi kung leh Aaron leh Miriam kungah, “Na thum un hing pawtdoh unlen, kimutuona biehbuh ah hing pei un,” thakhat in achi ta hi. Tuachi’n athum un ava pei ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa khu meilum dingin ahing kumsuh a, biehbuh kot bulah adinga, Aaron leh Miriam ahan hi: tuachi’n amautegel ahing pawtdoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh aman “Tu’n ka thu ngai un: Na lah ua guolnei a umleh Kei Mangpa’n kilahnain akungah ka kitheisah dinga, akung ah manglam in thu ka gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka suoh Mosi pen tuabang ahisih hi, ka innsung tungtang thuah a muon huoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama toh vang kimaituo in, thuguh umlouin kichientahin ka kihou ding ua; Mangpa mel zong amu ding: tuaziehin ka suohpa Mosi bang chi dan a gense ngam na hi uoi?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa lungthahna khu atung uah akuong ta a, apeisan ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh meilum ding khu akitawlmang ta a; tualeh ngaivawi, Miriam a hing phata a; vua bangin ahing ngouta hi, tualeh Aaron in Miriam a en a, ngaivawi amanu apha ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aaron in Mosi kungah, “Pu aw, ka tung uah mawna nga vawtsin, mot huoi tahin sil kana bawl ua kana bawlkhiel ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amanu vang, mi anu gilsunga kipata ahing pien chiil apata phalshisa bangin um sah vawt sin,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Mangpa kungah, “Amanu tuin sudam in, Aw Pasian ka hing ngen ahi,” chi in akikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi kungah, “Apa’n amaitang ah chil phitkhum hitaleh ni sagi sung azum sih ding amah? Giehphuol pulam ah ni sagi sung tuomkoi in um henlen, tuazou chiengin puilut kia hi hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Miriam khu giehphuol pulam ah ni sagi sung, tuom koiin a um a, mipite khu Miriam kipuilut kia masangsie, akisuon thei ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuazouin mipite khu Hazeroth akipan akisuon ua, Paran gamdai ah giehphuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel tate kunga ka pieh Kanaan gam va enkhe dingin mi sawl in: Israel nam sawm leh nite lah a lamkai, phung china vaihawmpa chiet na sawl ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Paran gamdai akipat in Mangpa thupieh bangin amaute a sawl ta hi: amaute abawn un Israel tate lah a lamkai chiet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tamte amin uh ahi; Reuben phunga pat Zakkur tapa Shammua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simeon phung apat Hori tapa Shaphat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Juda phung apat Jephunneh tapa Kaleb.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Issakar phung apat Joseph tapa Igal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim phung apat Nun tapa Hoshea.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Benjamin phung apat Raphu tapa Palti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zebulun phung apat Sodi tapa Gaddiel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joseph phung apat chipen Manasseh phung apat Susi tapa Gaddi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dan phung apat Gemalli tapa Sethur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asher phung apat Mikael tapa Sethur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Naphtali phung apat Vophsi tapa Nahbi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gad phung apat Maki tapa Geuel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamte gam enkhe dinga Mosi in a sawlte min ahi. Tualeh Mosi in Nun tapa Hoshea khu Joshua achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in amaute Kanaan gam enkhe dingin asawlta a, tualeh akung uah “Simlam gam zuon in pei unlen, singtang gam ah peitou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh gam bang chibang ahiei? a Gam sunga teng mite ahat uoi ahat sih uoi? Atam uoi atawm uoi chi leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Atenna gam uh ahoi leh hoilou, atenna khopi te uh puon inn ahiei, ahisihleh kulpi nei khopi ahiei chite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh gam hausa leh hoi ahiei, gam zawng ahiei? Gammang ahiei hilou; va enkhie unlen, hangsantahin um unlen agam theigate hing puo un achi hi.” Khum hun khu grep ga masa min hunlai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute apeitou ua, Zin gamdai a kipat in Hamath lutna Rehob tan dongin gam ava enkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh simlam gam ah apeitou ua, Hebron ava tung uhi, tuamun ah Anak tate Ahiman, Sheshai, leh Talmaite a um uhi (Hebron pen Izipt gam a Zoan khuo sangin kum sagi in akisat masa zaw hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh amaute Eshkol luiguom ahing tung ua, khunah Grep ga bomkhat asatkhie ua, mi niin chiengin a zawng khop vawt uhi. Tualeh amaun, kawlbuthei ga them khat leh theipiga zong ang puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khum mun khu Eshkol luiguom achi uhi, Israel taten khum mun apat grep ga bom asat khieh ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ni sawmli gam enkhie a atham zou un, ahing kilekia ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n ahing pei ua, Paran gamdai a Kadesh ah Mosi leh Aaron leh Israel mipite zousie kungah ahing tung ua; akung uah leh mipi zousie kungah thu ahing tut ua, agam theigate a ensah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh amauten Mosi kungah “Na hing sawlna gam ah kava pei ua, nawitui leh khuoizu luonna ana hi ngut ngei hi, tamte agama theigate ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh agam a mi umte mi thahat tah tah ahi ua, akhopite uh kulbang nei leh thupi tah tah ahi; tuathamlouin khum munah Anak tate zong ka mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua gam simlam ah Amalek mite a teng ua; tualeh Hitmite, Jebusmite leh Amormite singtang gam ah ateng uhi, tualeh Kanaanmite tuipi gei leh Jordan luipangte ah ateng uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kaleb in Mosi masangah mipite a daisah duam a, “Kisa un peitou paivai in, tua gam khu vala va ui, izou ngei ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh apeipi miten, “Tua mite va zou vawt sih vai, eite sanga ahat zoh zieh un,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten Israel tate kungah ava gam etkhiehna uh thu ahilou lam in atut ua; “Ka va etkhieh na gam sunga teng mite khu mi nehgam ching mi ahi ua, Tualeh tua gam sunga ka mi mute ukhu mi lien pipi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh khummun ah Nephilim a hing kipan Anak mite tua gam ah ka mu uhi. Amaute toh tein kou khu khuongbai bang bep ka hi ua, amaute mit mu in zong khuongbai bang bep ma ka hi uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi umkhawmte zousie aw ngaitah in akikou ua, khum zan in mipite akapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate zousie Mosi leh Aaron tungah aphunta ua, mipi umkhawmte zousie’n a kung uah, “Pasian in Izipt gamah hing na that gam vanglah zaw leh aw, ahisihleh Pasian in tam gamdai mun ah hing sulum sieng mai leh maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangdinga namsau a shidinga, izite leh itate mat a um ding giap a, Mangpa’n tam gam a ahing puitung adiei? Eite dingin Izipt gam a kilekia hoi zaw lou ding ade aw,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh khat leh khat akihou ua, “Lamkai khat bawl va ui, Izipt gamah kinuale kia mai vai,” achi u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi leh Aaron khu Israel mipi kikhawmte zousie masangah abohkhup ta ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh gam enkhete lah a tel, Nun tapa Joshua leh Jephunneh tapa Kaleb in a puonte uh abotkeh ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel tate kikhawm zousiete kungah, “En khe dinga kava vahna gam ukhu gam hoi mama ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Itung ua Mangpa alungdam leh tua gam ah ahing puilut dinga, ahing pe ding hi. Nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa tungah kiphin sih unlen, tua gam mite zong zau sih un, ineh ding tanghou ahi mai uhi, akidal na uh bangmalou a suohta, Mangpa eite kungah aum asiei mah, amaute zausih un,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh mipi umkhawmte zousien suonga se atum uhi. Tuachi’n Mangpa thupina khu, kimutuona biehbuh ah Israel tate zousie masang ah ahing kilang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi kungah, “Tam miten bangtan vei ahiei ahing thusimlou ding uh? Tualeh alah ua chiemtena ka bawl zelte nangawn zong bangtan vei ahiei agintat lou ding uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaute natpi in ka thatgam dinga, tualeh nangma akipat in amauh sanga thupi leh hatzaw nam khat bawlkhe zaw mai vang,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Mangpa kungah “Izipt miten za kha va uh; tam mite alah ua kipat a na thahatna a, na pui doh ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh amauten tam gammite ahil kha ding ua; azieh pen amauten, Nang Mangpa tam mite lah ah na um a, Mangpa nangma kimaituo in ahing mu ua, meipi atung uah aum lenga, tualeh sunin meipi khuomin, zanin meikuong in amasang uah na pei zel hi, chi azata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin tam mipite zousie thakhat a mikhat banga na tha leh vang Na minthanna za namten,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa’n tam mipite kunga pieh dinga achiem na gam a apuitung thei nawn lou ziehin, amaute gam dai ah athatgam ta hi chin agen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin ka hing ngen ahi, ka Mangpa silbawltheina khu suhthupi in umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa khu lungnemtah, khotuona lienpi nei, khelna leh thulimlouna ngaidam zel, siemtanglou a kiguotte mawh ha doh ngailou, pate khelna tate tunga khang thum khangli tan donga zong thuh zelpa chia na gen dung zui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na khotuona letdan dungzui leh tam mite Izipt gam a kipata tutan donga na ngaidam bangin, ngaidam in chi’n ka hing ngen ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh “Mangpa’n na thu bangin ka ngaidam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hinna leh Mangpa thupina in ahing dimsah ding leitung pumpi louin ka gen a hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izipt gam leh gamdai a, ka thupina leh ka sillamdang bawlte mu a, hichi pipi a zong sawm vei ving-veng hing ze et nalai lai a, ka thu zuilou nalai zousie ten;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Apu leh pate uh kunga, kichiem a pieh dinga ka chiem gam amu vawt sih ding uhi, alah ua kei hing thusimlouten zong amu het sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh ka suoh Kaleb in lungsim tuom apuo a, bukimtah a ahing zui ziehin ava peina gamah ka puilut dinga, ahahasuonten tua gam aluo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin Amalekmite leh Kanaanmite phaijang gam a aten ziehun; Zingchiengin kihei unlen; Tuipi san zotna lampi langah gamdai ah lut un,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi leh Aaron ahoupi a akung uah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tam mi thulimlou umkhawmte, ka tunga phun phunte bangtan ahiei kadaw thei ding, Israel tate ka tunga aphun na uh ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Akung uah gen in, ka hinna louin ka gen ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi, ka bila ka zah ngei a na gen bangun, tuabangin na tung uah ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na luong uh tam gamdai ah alum dinga, na lah ua mi kisimna a telsa zousie, kum sawm ni a upa apat atunglam ka tunga phun zousiete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na tenna ding ua hing bawl pieh dinga ka chiemna gam ah Jephunneh tapa Kaleb leh Nun tapa Joshua chilou na lut het sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh mi mat ding giap ahi ding uh chia na gen uh na tate uh ka puilut dinga, na deilou gam uh a thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanleh Noute pen na luong uh tami gamdai ah a lum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh na tate uh gamdai ah kum sawmli sung avah vai ding ua, na luong uh gamdai a abeimang masang sie, na kizua ziehun athuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gam nava etkhiet ni za uh ni sawm li, nikhat leh kum khat kibangin, kum sawm li sung na gitlouna uh, na thuoh law ding uhi. Tuachi’n ka tup ka hendan na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kei Mangpa’n miginalou umkhawm, kei hing dal a pungkhawmte tungah tam sil kabawl ngei ngei ding ka chita hi. Tam gamdai ah amangthai ding ua, ashi gam sieng ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi chiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh gam enkhe dinga Mosi in asawl hing kinualeten, gam umdan ahoilou lam a gen a mipi umkhawmte Mangpa tunga phun sahte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khum gam umdan aselam a hing tutte ngel khu Mangpa masangah natna hii in ashita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanleh Nun tapa Joshua leh Jephunneh tapa Kaleb, gam enkhe dinga asawlte lah a telte, ashi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in tam thute Israel tate zousie kungah ahil a: mipite lungkham in akapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n zingmawng matahin athou ua, muolvum ah akal tou ua, “En un, tam mun ah i um ua, Mangpa’n ang chiemna gam ah ipeitou ding uh, ina bawlkhielta uhi” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in akung uah, “Bang dinga Mangpa thupieh bawtsie na hi uoi? Apha tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na melmate uh masanga thagama na umlou nading un, peitou da mai un, azieh pen Mangpa’n ahing umpi sih hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na masang uah Amalekmite leh Kanaan mite a um uhi. Namsau a thagam in na um ding uh, Mangpa na kiheisan tah ziehun, na kung uah Mangpa a um sih ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hinanleh amauten muolvum a peitou atumtei tei ua; hinanleh Mangpa thuhun bawm leh Mosi giehphuol apat akisuon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua muol tunga teng Amalek mite leh Kanaan mite ahing kumsuh ua, amaute ahing satlum ua, Hormah mun dongin asatlum zeng zung uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel tate houpi inlen akung uah, na kung ua ka hing pieh na tenna ding uh gam na hing tun chieng ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa kunga mei sillat ahiei, halmang sillat ahiei, thuchiem tangtunna kithoina ahiei, nouma ut thu a sillat ahiei, na pawibawl ngaina hun guotte uh a hiei, ganhon lah ahiei, belam hon lah ahiei a, Mangpa dinga gimnamtui mei a sillat na bawl chiengun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa adinga sillat lan pa’n tangbuong nelte ephah se sawm suo sekhat, sathau hin se li suo se khat mehkhawm a alat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh dawn sillat dingin uoin hin khat seli suo sekhat halmang sillat ahiei, kithoina ahiei a, belamnou khat chiet a na bawl ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahisihleh belamtal adingin, ann sillat, tangbuong nelte ephah se sawm suo se ni sathau hin sethum suo sekhat kimehkhawm na bawl ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh dawn sillat dingin, Mangpa dinga gimnamtui dingin uoin hin khat sethum suo sekhat na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Halmang sillat ding ahiei, thuchiem tangtunna dinga kithoina ding ahiei, Mangpa kunga lemna sillat ding ahiei a, bawngtal na zah chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawngtal na lat toh kiton in ann sillat, tangbuong nelte ephah khat sesawm suo sethum sathau hin kim khat mehkhawm nalat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh dawn sillat dingin uoin hin kim khat, Mangpa dinga gimnamtui dingin, mei a sillat na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tuachibangin bawngtal a ding ahiei, belam tal ading ahiei, belam nou a dingin ahiei, kelnou adingin ahiei akibawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Atam dan dungzui in na bawl ding ua, atam dan bang zel un na lan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum gam sunga pieng zousie’n, Mangpa adinga gimnamtui mei a sillat alat ding chiengun tam bang in, tam sillatte abawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Namdang mi na lah ua na tengsate ahiei, ahisihleh koipou na lah ua akhang akhanga na tengsaten, Mangpa dinga gimnamtui mei a sillat alat ding u’leh noute bawl bangin aman zong abawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na khangtan ua dingin leh nou mipi umkhawmte leh nam dang na lah ua umte a dingin zong thugousie khat ahi ding ahi. Mangpa masang ah nam dangte zong noute bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nou a ding leh na kung ua um nam dangumte adingin dan khat leh tawndan kibang khat a um ding ahi,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Israel tate houpi inlen akung uah, ka hing puina ding gam na hing tun chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichi ahing hi ding a, agam a pieng ann na neh chiengun, Mangpa kungah vei sillat na lan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na tanghou meh masapen lah ua, beu khat vei sillat dinga na lat ding uh ahi; phuola vei sillat na vei bangun, na vei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na khang tungtawn un na tanghou mehmasahpen uh, Mangpa kunga vei sillat dinga na lat zel ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tualeh na tuploupi ua na suhkhel ua, Mangpa’n Mosi kunga agen thupiehte zousie na zui sih u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mangpa’n Mosi khut zanga, na kung ua thu ahing pieh zousie: Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh ni a kipat a, na khang tungtawn ua dinga athu piehte na zui sih u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hichi ahi dinga, mipi um khawmte theiloua, bawl khel khah ahileh, mipi umkhawmte zousie in halmang sillat Mangpa dinga gimnamtui dingin, bawngtal tuoi khat alan ding ua, adan ngaina bangin ann sillat leh dawn sillat toh khelna kithoina ding in kel tal khat zong alan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Siempuin Israel tate umkhawm zousie dingin kilem na abawlpieh dinga tuachi’n ngaidam ahi ding uhi; tuploupi a bawl khelna ahi ziehin: Tuachi’n amaun tuploupi a abawlkhelna zieh ua, Mangpa dinga mei a kithoina sillat leh Mangpa masanga khelna sillat ahing tawi ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate umkhawmte zousie, ngaidam ahi ding ua, alah ua namdang umte zong; mipiten atupmawng ua abawlkhel uh ahi lou ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tualeh mi khat in tupmawng hiloua bawlkhel anei khahleh aman khelna sillat dingin kum khat phapan kelnou anu khat alat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin tupmawng hilou a sil bawlkhielpa a dingin kilemna abawl pieh dinga: Mangpa masang a tupmawng hilou sil abawlkhiel chiengin kilemna abawl dinga; tuachi’n ngaidam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tupmawng hilou a sil bawlkhiel mi a dingin leh, a gam sunga pieng Israel tate leh nam dang alah ua umte adingin zong dan khat na nei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh thei sasa abawl ahileh vang gam sunga pieng hiin namdang mi hitaleh, Mangpa gensie ahia, tuapa khu amite lah a pat satkhieh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aman Mangpa athusim sih a, athupiehte apalsan ziehin, tua mipa khu satkhieh hil hel ding ahi, agitlouna man aman akipuoh ding ahi,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate gamdai a a um lai un, khawlni a singtom mi khat a mu ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua mipa sing tom laitah mutengin amapa khu Mosi leh Aaron leh mipi umkhawmte kungah ahing zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua mipa bang law ding ahiei chi agen chien thei nailou zieh un suongkul ah akhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi kungah “Tuamipa thalia ngei ngei ding ahi; giehphuol pulam ah mipi zousien suonga aselup ding uh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin mipi zousiein giehphuol pulam ah akaidoh ua, suongin aseplum ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Israel mipite kungah, akhang tungtawn un a puonmong uah khaupum kigah bawl uhenlen, among tep bawh ah khaudum khai uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua puon monga khaupum kigah na et ua nouten Mangpa thupieh zousie na thei zing na ding u’leh na zui na ding uh ahi; tualeh kizua a na um zel bang ua na lungtang deilam u’leh na mit la pouma uh dei a na umlou na dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka thupieh zousiete na theizing ua, na zui ua, tualeh na Pasian ua dinga na sienthou thei na ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kei Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi. Na Pasian uh ka hi theina dinga Izipt gam a kipata noute hing puidohpa Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Levi tapa Kohath tapa Izhar tapa Korah leh Eliab tapate Dathan leh Abiram leh Peleth tapa On, Reuben tapaten mite a pui ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel tate mi langsal deu deu mipi lah a lamkai vaihawmtu a telte lah a mi zani leh sawmngate toh Mosi masangah adingdoh ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi leh Aaron dou dingin akikhawmta ua, akung uah, “Kisathei sengta uteh, mipite lah a siengthou chiet ngal ua, michin a siengthou ua, Mangpa zong alah uah a um hi; bang zieh a Mangpa mipi umkhawmte tunga kikoi tungnung tuom na hi uoi?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in tua thu azah tahin alu tuolsu in akhupboh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh aman Korah leh apawlte zousie ahoupia akung uah “Zing chiengin Koite ahiei Ama ahi a, koite ahiei asiengthou chi ahing musah dinga; amauh akungah ahing pei sah ding hi chi’n agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hichiin bawl un, nou Korah leh apawlte zousie in gimnamtui halna belte kilah chiet unlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh asungah mei leh gimnamtui koi unlen zing chiengin Mangpa masang ah hal un, tualeh hichi ahi ding, Mangpa’n atel pouma asiengthou ding; nou Levi tapate aw na kisathei sengta uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Korah kungah “Nou Levi tapate aw ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa biehbuh a nasep sem ding leh mipite masang a ana uh semdinga ding dinga Israelte Pasian in Ama nai dinga Israel mipite lah akipat a ahing koituom na khu nou adingin sil neunou khat banga kilang giap ahiei mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akungah ahing um naisahta a, na kung ua um na unau Levi tapate zousie toh; Siempu hina na sui nalai u’maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin nang leh na pawlte zousie Mangpa dou ding in na kikhawm uh hi, Aaron bang ahia ahiei, atunga na hichi phun uh?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Eliab tapate Dathan leh Abiram han ding mi asawl a, amauten “Hing pei tou sih va ung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gamdai a thadinga, nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam apat na hing puidoh khu sil neu noukhat ahiei mah? Katung uah leengtapa bangin vai na hawm viel nalai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuagentahlou nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam a lah nang pui lut sih a, lou leh grep huon luo ding zong na hing pe sih hi: tam mite mit kheudoh sawm na hiei mah? Kang peitou sih ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi alungthah sengsenga, Mangpa kungah, “A sillat uh pompieh vawt sin, Ama ua kipat sabiltung khat zong ka la sih a, tualeh koimakhat siet na ding zong ka bawl sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Korah kungah, “Zing chiengin nang leh na pawlte Mangpa masangah hing um un, nang leh amaute tualeh Aaron toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh mi chin in na gimnamtui halna bel uh lachiet unlen, asungah gimnamtui koi un, tualeh Mangpa masangah michinin amei bel hing tawi uhen, mei bel zani leh sawm nga; nang leh Aaron in zong na mei bel uh hing tawi tuoh un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n michin in amei bel uh a tawi ua, asung ah mei akoi ua, tualeh gimnamtui ahal ua, Mosi leh Aaron toh kimutuona biehbuh kot phungah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Korah in Mosi leh Aaron dou ding in mipi zousie kimutuona biehbuh kotpi phungah aumkhawm sah a, tualeh mipi zousiete tungah Mangpa thupina ahing langta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi leh Aaron ahoupi a, akung uah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tam mipite lah a pat kihemkhie un, tha khat a ka suhmangthai thei na dingin”, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n amautegel abohkhup ua, “Aw Pasian tahsa zousie hagaute Pasian, mikhat gitlou ziehin mipite zousie tungah na lungthah ta lawm ding amah?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mipi umkhawmte kungah, “Korah leh Dathan leh Abiramte biehbuh akipat kikhin khieh san un chiin gen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi a dingdoh a, Dathan leh Abiram kungah ava haw a, Israel upaten azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh aman mipi umkhawmte kungah, “Tam migiloute puoninn apat pawtkhie unlen, abangma uh khoi sih un, tua chilouin akhelna uoh na katum kha ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute Korah, Dathan leh Abiramte biehbuh akipat apawtdoh zeng zung ta ua, tualeh Dathan leh Abiram ahing pawtdoh ua, apuoninn uh kotkha phungah a zite u’leh atapate u’leh atangehte utoh ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in “Keima lungsim a hing potdoh in bangma ka bawl sih a, tam silzousie bawl dingin Mangpa’n ahing sawl ahi chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam mite mi zousie shi dan ngaina banga ashi ua, ahisihleh mi zousie gawt ngaina banga gawt ahi giap u’leh Pasian in ang sawllou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n siltha khat abawla lei tangin akam akah a, anei zousie utoh amaute avaltum a, leimidawng a kintah a apeisuh u’leh tam miten Mangpa adei sih uh chi na thei ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, tam thute agen zoutahin, anuoi ua leitang ahing khipoh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh leitangin akam akah a, amaute a innkuon un Korah mite zousie anei alam zousie utoh avaltum siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama u’leh anei alam zousie utoh ahingtang un lei kohawmah akesuhta uhi, tuachi’n lei khu ahing kichi kia a, mipite lah a kipat a mangthai ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n akim ua um Israel mi zousiete khu akikou husa uah ataizah ta uhi, “Eite zong leitangin hing valtum khava achi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa a kipat in mei ahing Pawtkhie a, gimnamtui toi a um mi zani leh sawmngate akatum ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Nangman mei khu tendoh inlen siempu Aaron tapa Eliazar khu mei lah a pat gimnamtui halna lakhe dingin hil in, silsiengthou ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amauh hinna tung ngei a giloute gimnamtui halna belte zong la inlen, tuate khu maitam khuna kuong dingin kheng uheh, Mangpa masanga latsa ahi ziehin, asiengthou ahi, tuachi’n Israel tate dingin chiemtena ahi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu Eleazar in mi katumten analatsa uh gimnamtui halna sum-eng belte khu ala a, maitam khuna dingin akhengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Israel tate adinga atheizing na ding un, Aaron tate chilou namdang mawngmawng, Mangpa masanga gimnamtui hal dinga ahing pei nai lou na ding un, Mangpa’n Mosi zanga akunga agen bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hinanleh azing ni’n, “Mangpa mite na that gam tauh chi’n Israel tate mipi zousie Mosi leh Aaron tungah aphun ta uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahia, mipite Mosi leh Aaron dou dinga apunkhawm lai un, kimutuona biehbuh lam a en ua, tualeh ngaiun, meilum in ahing khu a, Mangpa thupina ahing kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi leh Aaron kimutuona biehbuh kotphungah ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupia akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Tam mipite lah a kipat kihemkhie un, thakhat a ka suhmangthai theina dingin achi hi,” tuachi’n amautegel amai uh leisu in bohkhup in apuo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Aaron kungah, “Gimnamtui halna bel la inlen asungah maitam a kipat a na lah, mei koi in, tualeh gimnamtui hal inlen kintah in mipite kungah pei inlen ama-ua dingin kilemna bawlpieh in, Mangpa akipata lungthahna apawt khiet tah ziehin hii aleeng panta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aaron in Mosi gen bangin, ala a, mipi lah ah atailut a, tualeh ngaiin hii khu mipite lah ah aleeng panta a, tualeh aman gimnamtui ahalkhum a, mipite dingin kilemna abawl pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh ama khu mi shi leh mihing kikaal ah adinga hii khu athengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n Korah tungtang thua a shite chilou hii a shite zousie tul sawm leh tul li leh za sagi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tualeh Aaron khu kimutuona biehbuh kotphung ah Mosi kungah ahing kile kia a, hii khu atheng ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel tate houpi inlen, Israel phung chin akipat chiengkhut khat chiet la inlen, aphung aphung dungzui zel ua, lamkaite upa pen zousie chiengkhut sawmleni la inlen tualeh achieng chiet uah amin chiet uh giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Levi chieng ah Aaron min gielin, aphung chin ua upa zousie adingin chiengkhut khat chiet a um ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n kimutuona biehbuh masanga ka hing kimupina mun a na koi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi dinga, ka teldingpa chiengkhut ahing seldoh dinga, tuachi’n Israel tate phunna na tunga aphunna uh ka tawp sah ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Israel tate ahoupi a, tuachi’n a phung chiet uh dungzui in, aphung lamkai chinteng un chieng khat chiet zelin chiengkhut sawm leh ni apie ua, tualeh Aaron chieng zong achieng lah uah atel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in chiengte khu, theipina biehbuh ah, Mangpa masangah akoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh azingni in hichi ahing hia, Mosi theipina biehbuh sungah ava lut a, tualeh ngaiin, Levi phungte a dinga Aaron chieng khut aseldoh a, apahmum a, ahing apahkhie a, kawlthualu ana gata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in chieng zousie Mangpa masanga kipat in Israel tate zousie kungah ahing tawidoh a, tualeh amauten a en ua, michinin achieng chiet uh akilah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi kungah, “Hel hatte ahi uh chi chiemte na dingin Aaron chiengkhut pen theipina masanga koi dingin hing nua tawi kia in, tuachi’n keima a kipat in ahelna uh na lamang ding hi ashilaw lou na ding un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in tuabangin abawl a, Mangpa’n thu apieh bang ngei in abawl ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Mosi kungah, “En in, ka shita uh, Mangthai ka hita uh, Mangthang sieng ka hita uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Koi hinanleh Mangpa biehbuh kung nai a hing pei pouma ashi ding: I unpi ua mangthai sieng ding ihita uh amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Aaron kungah, “Nang leh na tapate leh na pa innkuonpiten munsiengthou toh kisai a thulimlouna, bawlkhelna maw na pawding ua, tualeh nang leh na tapaten na siempu hina uh khelna maw na paw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh na pa chipi Levi phunga na unaute zong nang toh a sepkhawm theina dingun na kungah na um sah dinga, hinanleh nang leh na tapate theipina biehbuh masangah na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh amauten na nasep ahing hu ding ua, biehbuh nasep zousie asem ding ua, hinanleh munsiengthou a tuium belsuonte leh maitam pen hing nai sih uheh, amaute leh nangma na shi lou na ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amauten nang toh asemkhawm ding ua, biehbuh nasepna zousie a dingin, kimutuona biehbuh nasep atang ding ua, namdang mi na kung nai a ahing pei ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh mun siengthou nasepna leh maitam nasepna nangman na tang ding hi; Israel tate tunga lungthahna a um nawnlou na dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh ngaiin Keima mama in na unau Levite, Israel tate lah akipat in ka ladoh a, kimutuona biehbuh a nasep semdingin, Mangpa adinga silpiehin na kungah ahing kipeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin, nang leh na tapaten maitam leh puonzah sunglam a, na siempu nasep uh nasem ding ua, tualeh nangman nna nasem ding; Na siempu nasepna mun khu silpieh a nasepna banga ka hing pieh ahi: hinanleh nam dang mi na kung nai a hing pei pouma shi sah ding ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Aaron ahoupi a, “Ngaiin, Keima’n Kei a ding vei sillat, Israel tate sil lat siengthou zousie nang leh na tapate kumtawn a na tantuom dingun thugousie a ka hing pieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mei a hal val silsiengthoute nanga ahi dinga, asillat chinteng uh, a ann sillatte uh, akhelna kithoina sillatte uh, a gitlouna kithoina sillatte uh, ka kunga ahing lat ding zousiete uh, nang leh na tapate tantuom siengthou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mun siengthou pen ah tuami na ne ding ua, Pasal tengin ane ding ua; na tantuom ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh tami zong na tantuom ahi, ann sillat dinga asil piehte uh, Israel tate vei sillat zousiete tanin; nang leh natapate leh na tanute toh kumtawn a na tantuom dingun ka hing pie ahi; na Inn a mi siengthou zousien ane thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sathau hoipente leh uoin tha hoipente leh bu hoipente leh Mangpa kunga alat ding uh ga masate nang ka hing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh loua ga min masapen, Mangpa a dinga ahing tawite uh nanga ahi dinga; na inn a mi siengthou zousien ane theiding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israelte sillat pouma nanga ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa dinga apieh uh naubu hong masapen mihing hi in ganta hitaleh nanga ahi dinga; hinanleh ata chilpen vang na tat ngei ngei ding ahia, tualeh ganta sienglou anou pieng masapen zong na tat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ha khat a chin chiengin tat dingte tatna man na guot dan dungzuiin shekel nga a na tat ding ahi; (mun siengthou a kizah dung zuiin shekel khat Gerah sawmni) ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh bawngnou pieng masapen, belamnou pieng masapen leh Kelnou pieng masapen, na tat ding ahi sih, asiengthou ahi uhi; a sisan uh maitam tungah na the dinga, Mangpa a dinga gimnamtui dingin athaute uh mei a sillat dingin na hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asa uh nanga ahi dinga, vei sillat awm leh amal zietlam nanga ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sil siengthou vei sillat, Israel taten Mangpa kunga alat zousie uh, nang leh na tapate leh na tanute kungah kumtawn a thugousie dingin ka hing peta hi, tami nanga ding leh nahah nasuonte kunga, Mangpa masanga kumtawna ding chi a bawl thuhun, ahi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Aaron kungah, “Agam uah goutan na nei sih dinga, alah uah tanvou zong na nei sih ding hi: Israel tate lah a na tanvou leh na goutan khu Keima ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ngaiin, Keima’n Levi tate khu kimutuona biehbuh nasep asep man un, Israel gamsunga sawm a khat zousie agoutan dingun ka peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua kipat in Israel taten kimutuona biehbuh nai a ahing pei ding uh ahi sih hi, tuachilouin khelna man puoin ashi khading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh Leviten kimutuona biehbuh nasep asem ding ua, athulimlouna maw uh apo ding uh: Israel tate lah a goutan anei sih ding uhi, tami na khang tungtawn ua kumtawn thupieh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahivang in Israelte tate sawma khat, Mangpa a dinga vei sillat dinga alat ukhu Levite goutan dingin ka peta ahi: tuaziehin akung uah Israel tate lah-ah goutan na nei sih ding uh, ka chisa mawng ahita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tambangin Levite houpi inlen, akung uah hichiin gen in, na goutan ding ua Israel tate sawma khat ka hing pieh na lah chiengun, tuami sawma khat apat sawma khat Mangpa a dingin vei sillat in na lan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n na vei sillatte uh nou adingin phuola bu kipie bang leh uoin suhna dim banga sim ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hichibangin nou zong Israel tate akipat a na mu uh, na sawm ua khatte ua pat Mangpa dinga vei sillat dingin na lan ding uhi; tualeh tua Mangpa vei sillat khu Siempu Aaron kungah na pe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Silpieh na mu zousiete lah a pat ahoipen, a siengthou pen, zousie Mangpa vei sillat dingin na lan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaziehin akung uah, tua ahoipen na vei chiengin, tua khu Levite a dingin phuola bu tung leh uoin suhna a uoin tung banga sim ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuakhu nang leh na innkuonpiten heisung mun pou ah zong na ne thei ding uhi, kimutuona biehbuh a na nasep man uh ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahoipen na vei chiengun akhelna maw na paw sih ding ua, Israel tate sil siengthou na suthanghuoi ding uh ahi sih, tuachilouin na shi khading uhi chiin.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi leh Aaron ahoupi a, akung uah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tami Mangpa dan thupieh thugousie khu ahi. Israel tate kungah, bawngla san gensiet bei khat, a ngawnga hahkol kibat ngainailou, na kunga hing kai dingin gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuakhu siempu Eleazar kungah na peding ua, aman giehphuol pulam ah a kaidoh dinga, amasang ah koi ahiei khat in athat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Siempuin akhutme in asisan ala dinga, kimutuona biehbuh mailam ah sagi vei athe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n bawngla khu koi ahiei khat in amitmu ah ahaldinga; avunte, asate, asisante leh a eehte toh ahal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin sidar sing leh hissop leh puonsandup ala dinga bawngla kihalna laiah apailut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempuin apuonte asawp dinga, tuiin akisil ding a, tuazou chiengin giehphuol ah ang pei dinga, tualeh siempu khu nitah lam dongin sienglou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh ahal pa’n tui in apuonte asawp dinga, tuiin akisil dinga, tualeh nitah dong in sienglou ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh mi sieng khat in tua bawngla kihalna vamte ala khawm ding a, giehphuol pulam a mun sieng khat ah akoi dinga, Israel mipi kikhawmte dingin kisiensuona tui dinga koi ahi ding hi: tuakhu khelna suhsiengthouna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh bawngla vam luohkhawm pa’n apuonte a sawp dinga, nitah dongin sienglou ahi ding hi; Tam khu Israel tate ding leh alah ua mi namtuom umte dingin kumtawn thugousie ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Koipou mishi luong khoikha pouma abua ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua mi khu ni thum ni in akisusieng dinga ni sagi ni’n asiengta ding hi, hinanleh nithum ni a akisuhsieng sihleh ni sagi ni’n asieng sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Koipou mishi luong khoi a akisuhsieng sihleh Mangpa biehbuh asubua ahi; tuabang mi khu Israel tate lah a pat satkhieh ding ahi, kisiensuona tui atunga the ahilou ziehin asieng sih ding hi, asienlouna atungah a um nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Puoninn sunga mi ashi chienga dan ding tami ahi: puoninn sunga hing lut zousie leh puoninn sunga um zousie ni sagi a sieng sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh tuium belsuon asin neilou a kihong pouma abua ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh koizong gam lah a namsau a mi kithat ahiei, mishi luong ahiei, mishi gu ahiei, han ahiei khoikha pouma ni sagi sung asienglou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh mi siengloute sienna dingin, khelna silsiengna bawngla halna vam ala ding ua, bel ah tui luonglai tui toh a sung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi sieng khat in hissop ala dinga, tui ah adie dinga, puoninn tungleh, tui um belsuonte zousie tung leh khuna um mi zousie tung leh mishi gu ahiei, akithat luong ahiei, ashi ahiei, ahisihleh han khoikhapa tungah athe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh mi siengpa’n asiengloupa tungah nithum ni leh ni sagi niin athe dinga, ni sagi niin akisusieng dinga; apuonte asawp dinga, tuiin akisil dinga, nitah lam in asiengta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Hinanleh mi sienglou hi a, tualeh kisuhsienglou mi khu, mipi umkhawmte lah apat satkhieh ahi ding hi, aman Mangpa mun siengthou asubuata a, kisuhsiengna tui atunga akithe khah lou ziehin, ama pen a sienglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tami ama ua dingin kumtawna zuiding dan ahi ding, koipou kisiensuona tui the phot in apuonsilte a sawp ding a, tualeh koipou kisiensuona tui sukha pouma nitah dongin asienglou ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh mi koizong mi sienglouin asuhkhah pouma asieng lou ahi ding ua, tualeh tua mipa khoi kha pouma zong nitah dongin asieng sih ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel mipi umkhawm zousie ahakhatna in Zin gamdai ah alut ua, tualeh mipiten Kadesh ah giehphuol abawl ua, tua mun ah Miriam ashi a, khunah avui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh mipi umkhawmte dingin tui a um tasih a; tuachi’n Mosi leh Aaron tungah lungkimlou in akikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh mipiten Mosi akiselpi ua, “Mangpa masanga i unaute ashi lai un, Pasian in hing na that lum zawta mai leh maw, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangdinga Mangpa mipite gamdai a shi dinga na hing puilut ahiei? Kou leh ka gantate utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangdinga tam mun hoilou a puilut dinga Izipt gam a kipat a nang pawtsah ahiei? Bu leh balte, theipite, grepte, kawlbutheite umlouna mun ahi a, tui dawnding mawngmawng lah a um sih a,” chi’n Mosi akinielpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi leh Aaron khu mipi umkhawmte lah a kipat in kimutuona biehbuh kotphungah apeita ua, khupbohin apuata uhi. Tuachi’n Mangpa thupina akung uah ahing kilang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a akungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na chiengkhut la inlen, mipite hankhawm inlen, nang leh na sanggampa Aaron toh, a mit mu ngei ua tui hing pulkhesah dingin tua suongpi khu houpi in, tuachi’n suongpi akipat tui na lahdoh pieh dinga, tuachi’n mipite leh aganhonte uh dawn ding tui na pe ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Mangpa masanga pat chieng khut athupieh bangin ala ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi leh Aaron in, suongpi masangah mipite akikhawmsah ua, akung uah, Tuin nou mihelhatte aw “Ngai un, tam suongpi akipat tui ka hing lahkhiet pieh ding uh ahiei mah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in aban azah a, achiengin suongpi nivei asat a, tuitampi ahing luongkhie a, tualeh mipi kikhawmte leh aganhonte un adawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi leh Aaron kungah “Na hing gingta sih ua, Israel tate mit mu ah na hing pahtawi ut sih uhi; tuaziehin tam mipite ka piehna gamah na puilut sih ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami Meribah tuite ahi: aziehpen Israel taten Mangpa aphin ua, amasang uah pahtawi in ka um sih hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Kadesh a kipat in Edom Lengpa kungah thangkou asawl a, “Na sanggampa Israel in tambangin agen hi, ka tung ua gentheina hing tung zousie na thei a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka pu leh pate uh Izipt gam ah apeisuh ua, Izipt gam ah hun sawtpi ka teng uhi, tualeh Izipt miten kou leh ka pu leh pate uh ahing genthei bawl mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa kunga ka kikou u’leh ka aw uh aza a, vansawlsieng ahing sawl a, Izipt gam a pat ahing puidoh ta hi, tualeh ngaivawi na gamgi ninga khopi khat Kadesh ah ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hepitahin na gam tawnin hing pei sah in; loute ahiei, grep huonte ahiei lah ah ka pei sih ding ua, tuikhuh a tuite zong ka dawn sih ding uhi. Leengpa lamlien zuiin ka pei ding ua, na gamgi ka hen masansie uh zietlam ahiei, veilam ahiei ah zong ka kihei sih ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Edomin akungah, “Ka gam nang tot ding ahi sih, ahisihleh noute dou dingin namsau toh ka hing kuon ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten akungah, “Lamlien zuiin ka pei ding uh, kou leh ka gantate un na tui kadawn ua ahileh aman ka’ng pe ding uh, kengin pei va ung in bangma bawl sih va ung,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh aman “Nang pei thei sih ding uh” achi hi. Tuachi’n Edom ama dou dingin galkap thahat tahtah leh mipi tampi toh ahing kuonkhe ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabangin Edom in agam sunga Israel peisuoh ding aphal sih hi. Tuachi’n ama apat in Israel mite a kihem mangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kadesh apat in apawtkhie ua, Israel mipite leh mipi kikhawm zousie Hor muol ah ahing tungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Edom gam zula um Hor muol ah Mosi leh Aaron ahoupi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Aaron pen achipite kunga pui ahita ding, Meribah tui mun a ka thupiehte kal a na hel ziehun, Israel tate kunga ka pieh gam ah alut sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aaron leh atapa Eleazar Hor muol ah hing zawpi tou in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Aaron puonsilte hohkhie’n len, atapa Eleazar silsahin, Aaron pen achipite kungah puitou in aumta dinga, tua mun ah ashi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thupieh dungzuiin Mosi in abawla; mipi umkhawm zousie mitmu in Hor muol ah apeitouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Aaron puonsilte ahohkhiet pieh a, atapa Eleazar asilsahta hi; tualeh Aaron tua muolvum ah ashita hi. Tuachin Mosi leh Eliazar khu muol a kipat in ahing kumsuhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi umkhawm zousie in Aaron ashita chi athei un, Israel innkuon mi zousie in ni sawmthum sung Aaron asuun uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n simlam a teng Kanaan mi Arad leengpa’n Israel tate Atarim lampi ah ahing pei uh chi azah in Israel tate anadouta hi, tuachi’n mi pawlkhat sal in amanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten Mangpa kungah thuchiem abawl ua, “Tam mite ka khut ua na hing pieh pouma leh akhopite uh ka susietpieh sieng ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Israel tate aw angaikhiet pieh a, Kanaan mite akhut uah apekheta hi, Tualeh Israelten amaute leh akhopite uh asusegam sieng uhi, tuaziehin tua mun khu Hormah akichi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute Hor muol a kipat in tuipi san lam zuon in Edom gam kimkot a pei dingin akipankheta uhi; tualeh lampi ah mipite alungke mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh mipiten Mosi leh Pasian phin in, “Bang dinga gamdai a shi dinga, Izipt gam a kipata na hing puidoh ahiei? Tanghou lah umlou, tui lah umlou, tami pannabei tanghou ka hinna un achimtaah gawpta hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n mipite lah ah gul gusuate ahing sawl a, mite atu ua, Israel mipite tampi ashi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin mipite Mosi kungah ahing pei ua, akungah, “Nangma leh Mangpa douna thu kana gen tahzieh un sil ka bawlkhielta uhi, kalah uapat gulte lahdoh dingin Mangpa kungah ngen in” achi ua; tuachi’n Mosi in mipite adingin thu anget pieh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi kungah “Gul gusuachi khat lim bawl inlen khuom dawn ah khai in tualeh hichi ahing hi dinga, koi hinanleh gul tuh pouma in tuakhu a et leh adam ding,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in sum-eng in gul abawl a khuom dawn ah akhai a, tualeh hichi ahing hi a, gul tuh mi pouma in tua sum-eng gul lim a et u’leh a dam zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate apei zel ua, Oboth munah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Oboth a kipat apei kia ua, nisuonalam a Moab gamdai bul Iye-barim mun ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuana kipat in apei kia ua, Zared phaijang ah giehphuol asat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuana kipat in apei kia ua, Amonmite gamgi akipat a hing dawh tuom gamdai a um Arnon lelampangah giehphuol abawl ua, Arnon khu Moab mite gamgi ahia, Moab mite leh Amor mite kikaal a um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa galdouna laibu ah “Suphah a um waheb Arnon luita guomte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ar tenna a luongsuh luitate tui, Moab gamgi zul a, Arnon luita guom ah akinga hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuana kipat in Beer ah apei kia ua, khum khu Mangpa’n Mosi kungah, “Mipite hankhawm inlen, tui ka pe ding,” achina tuikhuh mun khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel ten tami la asa uhi, “Aw tuikhuh hing luongkhie inlen, zailan awi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leng tapate leh mipi lamkaite leh, Dansiem miten alal chieng utoh atawdoh uh tuikhuh, chi’n la asa uhi.” Tualeh gamdai a kipat in Matanah lam zuonin apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Matanah akipat in Nahaliel ah, Nahaliel apat in Bamoth ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Bamoth akipat in, Moab phaijang leh gamdai kimu suh theina, Pisgah muolvum ahing tungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten Amormite leengpa Sihon kungah thangkou asawl ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Na gamsung tawnin in hing pei suoh sah in, loute ahiei, grephuonte ahiei ah lam piel sih va ung, tuikul a tuite zong ka dawn sih ding uhi, na gamsung uh ka kantan masang sie uh leengpa lamlien zuiin ka pei ding uh,” achisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh Sihon in Israelte agamsung tawn a apei ding uh aphal sih hi: tuachi’n Sihon in amipite zousie ahankhawma, gamdai ah Israel dou dingin akuon a, Jahaz mun ahing tunga, Israelte toh akidouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelten Sihon khu namsau hiemtah in athat ua azouta uhi, tuachi’n agam khu Arnon apat in Jabbok tan, Ammon mite gam dongin, Ammon mite gamgi khu kulpi a ki-im ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten tam khopite zousie ala ua; tuachi’n Heshbon gamsunga Amormite khopi zousie sungah ateng ua, akhota zousie uah zong ateng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Heshbon khu Amormite leengpa Sihon khopi ahia, Aman Moab gam leeng masapa akidoupi a akhut a pat agam zousie alah pieh a, Arnon tandongin alah pieh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin laphuo siemten, “Heshbon ah hing pei unlen, Sihon khopi siemtha leh tunding hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Heshbon apat in mei apawtkhie a, Sihon khopi akipat in mei akuongdoh a, Moab a Ar akatumta. Arnon mun sanga mi liente.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na tung uh agih hi, Moab, Suhmang na hita, Aw Kemosh mipite, Atapate khu taimang dingin, Atanute khu sal a pui dingin Amormite leengpa Sihon kungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute a kap ua, Heshbon suhsiet ahita, Debon dongin, Tuachi’n Nophah dongin ka sugam siengta uh, Medeba tan dongin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hichibangin Israelte, Amormite gamah ateng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi-in Jazer enkhe dingin mi asawl a, tuatah a, akhuote ala ua, tuana um Amormite adeldoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh akihei ua, Bashan lampi ah apeitou uhi. Tuachi’n Bashan leengpa Og amite zousie toh Israelte dou dingin Edrei mun ah ahing kuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi kung ah, “Ama giing sin ama leh amite zousie leh agam na khut ah ka hing pekheta hi. Heshbona teng Amorte leengpa Sihon tunga na bawl bang in atungah na bawl ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama leh atapate leh amite zousie hing khawi mawngmawng neilou in, amite zousie toh athatgam ua agam aluo pieh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate apei zel ua, Jerikou zawn a Jordan suolam panga Moab phaijang ah giehphuol asat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Zippor tapa Balak in Israel miten Amormite abawl dan zousie uh athei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Moab miten Israelte agiing mama ua, atam mama ziehun; Moabte khu Israel tate ziehin azau mama ua, achimawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Moab miten Midian upate kungah, “Tam mipiten bawngtal in gam lah a hampa amaitum bangin,” tu’n i kimvel ua mi zousie maitum sieng ding ahi uh achi uhi. Khum hunlaiin Zippor tapa Balak Moabmite leengpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin aman Beor tapa Balaam, Pethor a um kungah mi asawl a, (tua khu amite hahlesuonte gam a luong lui kunga um ahi) ama ava han a, akungah “Ngaiin Izipt gam a kipat a hing pawtdoh mihonpi a um ua, ngai in leitung zousie atuom suoh ua, Keima toh kigalsai in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin hepitahin hing pei inlen tam mite hing gausap piehin, Kei a dingin ahat seng taluo uhi; ka zaw thei khah laizang ua, ka gam uapat ka deldoh thei khah u’leh; na guolzawl poumate guolzawl in a um ua, na samsiet poumate samsiet in a um uh chi ka thei hi,” chi dingin mi asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Moab upate leh Midian upaten aisan manding tawi in apawtkhe ta ua, tualeh Balaam kungah ahing tung ua, Balak thu hahte akungah agen ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh aman akung uah “Tuzan vang tanah gieh unlen, Mangpa’n ang hil bangbangin na kung uah, thu kahing tut kia ding” achi hi. Tuachi’n Moab mi liente Belam kungah agieh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam kungah Pasian ahing pei a, “Na kunga mite koite ahi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam in Pasian kungah, “Zippor tapa Balak Moab leengpa’n ka kungah mi ahing sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngaiin Izipt gam a kipata hing pei mipiten leitung zousie atuom suoh ua, hing pei inlen hing gausap piehin, amaute ka zaw-a, ka deldoh zou khah laizang leh chiin mi ahing sawl hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in Balaam kungah, “Akung ua nava haw ding ahi sih; tua mite zong na gausap ding ahi sih: amauh mi hamphate ahi uh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam zingmawng in athou a, Balak miliente kungah, “Na gam lam uah peikia ta un, aziehpen Mangpa’n na kung ua haw ding ahing phal sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Moab miliente khu adingkhie ua, Balak kungah apei ua, “Balaam kou toh hing pei ding a ut sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balak in milien tamsem, asang ua zatat um zaw sem asawlkia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaute Balaam kungah ahing tung ua, akung uah, “Zippor tapa Balak in tambangin achi hi; ka kunga nang pei ding bangmain hing dal sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi thupi tahin ka hing bawl dinga ka kunga na gen pouma ka bawl zel ding hi. Tuaziehin hepitahin hing pei inlen; tam mite hing gausap pieh mama mai in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam in Balak mite adawnga, akung uah “Balak in dangka leh sana a inn dim hing pe ding hinanleh achinglou leh avaal bawl dingin Mangpa ka Pasian thu kal in ka gamta thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, Mangpa’n ka kunga bang ahiei agen nahlai ding ka theina dingin hepitahin tuzan zong tamnah ka kungah gieh un” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian in Balaam kungah, zanlaiin ahing pei a, akungah “Mite nangma han dinga hing haw ahi u’leh, kisa inlen amaute toh peiin, hinanleh na kunga ka gente maimai na bawl ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam zingmawng in athoudoh a, asabiltung asiem a, Moab miliente toh apeikhawm ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n ava pei ziehin Pasian alungthah mama ta a, tualeh alampi dal dingin, Mangpa vansawlsieng a lampi ah a dinga, amapen sabiltung tungah atuonga, asuohte ni zong ama toh azawhkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh sabiltung in Mangpa vansawlsieng lampi a ding amu a, akhutin namsau atawi a, tualeh sabiltung khu lampi apat apielkhie a, gam lah ah apei a tuachi’n Balaam in sabiltung khu lampi zuisah kia tum in azep a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa vansawlsieng khu grep huon kikaal lampi khat ah adinga alelam tuoh ah grep huon iimna baang a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh sabiltungin vansawlsieng amu tahin baang ava phu a, tuachi’n Balaam keng khu bang toh anamdenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa vansawlsieng khu apam deu ah apei a, zietlam leh veilam a kiheina ding umlouna mun kochih khat ah ana dingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh sabiltungin Mangpa vansawlsieng amutahin, Balaam nuoi ah apua a; tuachi’n Balaam alungthah a, sabiltung khu chiengin ajep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n sabiltung khu aham sah a, Balaam kungah, “Na tungah bang ka bawla ahiei? Thum vei tah na hing hichi zep?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Balaam in sabiltung kungah “Na hing simmaw ziehin ahi, namsau na tawita maleng ka hing satlum zouta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n sabiltungin Balaam kungah, “Nanga ka hi ni a kipat a tuni donga ka tunga na tuon zingna na sabiltung hilou ka hiei mah? Hichibangin na tungah ka bawl ngai amah?” Achi a, a man “bawl ngailou” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Balaam mit a suh vah pieh a, Mangpa vansawlsieng lampi a ding leh akhut a namsau dawsa tawi amuta a; tuachi’n akuun a, amai a leisu in akhupbohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa vansawlsiengin akungah, “Bangdinga na sabiltung thum vei zen na zep ahiei? Ngai in sietna bawl dinga ka hing mu ziehin nangma dal dingin ka hing pawtdoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n sabiltungin kei ahing mu a, thum vei zen kei apat akihei mang ahi. Kei apat a, kiheimanglou na hitaleh, ama that louin, nangma ka hing that zouta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Balaam in Mangpa vansawlsieng kungah, “Sil ka bawlkhielta hi; aziehpen keima dal in lampi ah na ding chi ka thei sih hi. Tuaziehin tami na lung damna ahisihleh, ka kile kia mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa vansawlsieng in Balaam kungah, “Mite toh peiin: hinanleh na kunga ka gen bang banga na gen ding ahi,” achi hi, tuachi’n Balaam khu Balak mi liente toh azawh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Balak in Belam ahing pei chi azahin gam ning tawpa Arnon gamgi a um Moab khopi khat ah ama dawn dingin akuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Balak in Balaam kungah, “Phatuom ngaitahin Nangma han dingin mi ka hing sawl asiei mah? Bang dinga ka kung hing haw nuomlou na hiei? Mi thupi tahin hing bawl zoulou ding ka hiei mah?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam in Balak kungah, “En in na kungah kang hawta hi: tuin bang thu gen theina mawngmawng ka nei a ahiei mah? Pasian in ka kama thu akoite maimai ka gen ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam, Balak toh azawhkhawm ta a Kirjath-huzoth mun ahing tung ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balak in bawngtal leh belam kithoi na’n alan a, Balaam leh akunga um miliente kungah ahalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n azing ni’n hichi ahing hi a, Balak in Balaam azawpi a, Baal mun sangte ah azawpi tou a, tua mun a kipat in mipite umna chieng chieng amu theina ding in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam in Balak kungah, “Tam mun ah maitam sagi hing bawlpieh inlen, tualeh bawngtal sagi leh belamtal sagi hing suhtuo piehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Balak in Balaam gen bang in abawla, Balak leh Balaam in maitam chinteng tungah bawngtal khat leh belamtal khat alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Balaam in Balak kungah, “Na halmang sillat kungah ding inlen, kei kava pei tuom ding hi; Mangpa kei hing kimupi dingin ahing pei kha thei hi, tualeh ahing, theisah pouma kang hil ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n muol sang khat ah apeitou ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian in Balaam akimupi a, tualeh aman akungah, “Maitam sagi ka bawla, maitam chinteng tungah bawngtal khat leh belamtal khat ka lanta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Balaam kamah thu akoi a, Balak kungah “Kile kia inlen tam bangin va gen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Balaam khu Balak kungah ahing kile kia ta a, tualeh ngaivawi, ama leh Moab milien tengtoh halmang kithoina sillat kungah ana ding nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman thu agen ta a, “Aram akipat in Moab leengpa Balak in suolam muol a kipat in ahing zawpi a, Hing pei inlen Jakob hing gausap piehin, Hing pei inlen Israel hing housie in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangchin Pasian gausap loupi ka gausap thei diei? ahisihleh Pasian housiet loupi ken bangchi housiet ding ka hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen Suongpi tungte akipat in ama ka mu a, muolte akipat in ama ka en hi: Ngaiin tam mite nam tuom ahi ua, nam dangte lah ah simtel ahi sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Koi ahiei Jakob leivui sim zou a, tualeh Israel se li suo sekhat sim zou ding? Midihtatte shi bangin ka shi dinga Katawpna khu ama a bang hileh,” achi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balak in Balaam kungah, “Nang bawldanpi bangchidan ahiei? Ka melmate gausap dingin ka hing zawpi a, Ngai in bailamtahin na guolzawl zawta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam in adawnga, “Mangpa’n ka kam a akoi gen dinga ka pilvang ngeingei ding hi zawlouding amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balak in akungah, “Hepitahin Mundang ah pei vai in, tuatah a pat in amaute na mu thei ding, a umna chieng chieng uh na mu thei dinga, a bawn un vang na mu sieng kholsih dinga; tuatah a kipat in hing gausap piehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Zophim lougam a Pisgah muol vum ah azawpi tou a, maitam sagi abawl a, maitam teng tungah bawngtal khat leh belamtal khat chiet alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh aman Balak kungah, “Pamlam a Mangpa kava ki houpi sungin, na halmang sillat kungah na ding khin-khian in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Balaam ana kimupi a, akam ah thu akoi a, Balak kungah “Pei kia inlen, tuabang ma in gen in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n akungah ahing pei a, Ngaiin ahalmang kithoina sillat kungah ana ding nalai a, Moab miliente zong akungah a um uhi, tuachi’n Balak in akungah, “Mangpa’n bang ana gen eile?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman tam thute agenta hi: “Thou inlen Balak Ngaikhiein, Zippor tapa ka thu ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasian khu zuouhat mihing ahisih a, Kisia pai mihing tapa zong ahi sih hi. Athugen bawl lou ding ahiei mah, Agensa atangtungsah sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngaiin, guolzawl ding thupieh ka mu a, Aguol zou ahita hi, ka bawl lamdang thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman Jakob ah thulim louna amu sih a, Israel ah phengphitna amu vawt sih hi, Mangpa a Pasian akungah a um a, Lengpa pahtawina kikou husa a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izipt akipat in Pasian in apuidoh a, Gam bawngtal thahatna anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen Jakob tungah bum-ngolna aum sih a; Israelte tungah dawi-aisanna a um sam sih hi: Tuin Jakob tungtang leh Israel tungtangah, Pasian in bang ahiei abawltaah, akichi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngai in tam mipite khu humpibahneipi bangin athou a, humpibahnei lunlai bangin a ding doh ding a; asa mat aneh masangsie leh asa tha si adawn masangsie a lum sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Balak in Balaam kungah, “Amaute, gausap sinlen, guol zong guolzawl sin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh Balaam in adawnga, Balak kungah, “Mangpa’n agen zousie ka bawl ding ahi chi ka hing hil sih amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Balak in Balaam kungah, “Hepi tahin hing zui inlen mun dang khat ah ka hing zawpi ding: tua mun akipat in amaute na hing gausap pieh Pasian in aphal kha maw sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balak in Balaam khu Peor muol vum a senel gam etsuhna ah azawpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam in Balak kungah, “Tam munah maitam sagi hing bawl pieh inlen bawngtal sagi leh belamtal sagi hing suhtuo piehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Balak in Balaam gen bangin abawla, maitam teng tungah bawngtal khat chiet leh belamtal khat chiet alanta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam in Israelte guolzawlpieh khu Pasian lungdamna ahi chi amutah in, nidanga abawl bangin aisan na bawl dingin apei sih a, gamdai lam azuon zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Balaam adahdoh leh Israel mite amauh aphung dungzui chiet ua giehphuol ua um amu a, Pasian Hagau atungah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman tam thute agenta hi, “Beor tapa Balaam in thu agen a, amit suhvah pieha umpa’n agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian thute za a, Bangkimbawlthei kilahna mu a, khupboh a pua a mit hing vahpa thugen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na puon innte kilawm hina e Aw Jakob! Na biehbuhte Aw Israel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Phaijang bangin akipha diem duoma, lui gei a huonte bang ahia, Mangpa’n asuonsa aloe singkung bang ahia; Tui gei a Sidar sing bang ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Atui bel apat tui asungkhe dinga, Tuitamna mun ah haichite achiing dinga, Aleengpa Agag sangin athupi zaw ding a, Aleenggam khu pahtawi in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasian in Izipt apat in apuidoh a, Gam bawngtal thahatna bang anei hi, Amelma namdangte ane tum ding a, Aman agute uh ahieh guoipieh dinga, Athal tang un akap pailet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kun a humpibahnei bangin alum a, Tualeh humpibahnei bang maiin; Koi ahiei ama phong ngamding? Nangma hing guolzawl pouma, Guolzawl in um henlen, Nangma hing gausap pouma, gausap in umta heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam tungah Balak alungthah mama ta a, akhutte gel atum a, Balak in Balaam kungah, “Ka melmate gausap dingin ka hing han a, tuin Ngai in thum vei vingveng na guolzawl zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin na umna mun ah taimangin: thupitah a hing tawisang ding ka hingchi na hi a, hinanleh ngaiin Mangpa’n pahtawi a na um ding ahing dalta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Balaam in Balak kungah, “Ka kunga na hing sawl thangkoute kungah zong kana gen sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Balak in a inn dim dangka leh sana hing pe ding hinanleh keima thua ahoilam ahiei, aselam ahiei bawl dingin Mangpa thupieh ka palsan thei sih ding hi. Mangpa’n agen pouma ka gen ding ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh tuin ngaiin, ka mite kunga peiding ka hita: tuaziehin hing pei inlen, ni nukhia lam chienga tam miten, na mite tunga abawl ding uh ka hing hil ding hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman tam thute agen ta hi: “Beor tapa Balaam, mit vah sah a um pa’n thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasian thute za a, Tungnung pen bangkimbawlthei pa kilaahna mu a, khupboh a pua a, mit hing vah tain:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama ka mu ding, tuin vang hilouin, ama ka en a nainou khat vang hilouin, Jakob akipat Aasi khat ahing suoh dinga, Israel akipat in lalchieng khat ahing dingkhe dinga, Moab gamsung asun pailet dinga Sheth tate zousie asumangthai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Edom khu atan ahita dinga, Seir zong amelmate tan ahita ding hi, Israel in hangsan tahin abawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakob akipat in gam uhpa ding ahing pieng dinga, tualeh khopi sunga um sun teng akisumang sieng ding hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Amalek lam a en a, tam thu a gen hi. “Amalek khu namte bulpipen ahi na a, Hinanleh a dawnlam manthaina ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Ken lam a en a, thu agen a, “Na umna mun adet hi, na bu suongpi tungah na sep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangtenghileh Kenmite khu Assiria sal a ahing puimang masangsie’n suh mangthai in a um ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh aman tam thu agenkia a, “Kadeisei! Pasian in tambanga sil abawl leh, koita ahing zou diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Kittim gam akipat tembawhte a hing. Tung dinga. Asshur leh Eber asugenthei ding ua, Tualeh ama zong amangthai ding hi;” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Balaam a thoukhie a inn langah apei kiata hi; tualeh Balak zong a inn langah akipeita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelte Shittim ah a um ua, tualeh mipiten Moab tanute toh angkawmna khelna ahing bawl panta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh amauten a pasiente u’kunga akithoinate uah achiel ua, tuachi’n annte aneh pi ua, apasiente uh bie in amasangah abohkhupta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelten Baal-Peor azopta ua, tualeh Mangpa lungthahna khu Israelte tungah ahing kuongkhe ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi kungah, “Mipite lamkai zousie zawpi inlen. Mangpa lungthahna zauhuoi tah mai Israelte tunga kipata akikhimmang theina dingin sun nisa vah nuoi a Mangpa masangah khailia siengin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Israel thukhen vaihawmte kungah, “Michin in Baal-peor toh kizopna nei na mite uh that sieng un achita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh ngaiin, Israeltate lah a khat in, kimutuona biehbuh kot phunga akaa laitah un Mosi mitmu leh Israel mipi kikhawmte mitmu in Midian numei khat a unaute kungah ahing zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh siempu Aaron tapa Eleazar tapa Phinehas in amutahin mipi lah akipat in adingdoh a, akhut in teipi khat ala hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Israel pasalpa khu biehbuh sungah adellut a, Israel pasalpa leh numeinu khu ani ua agilpi uah asun pailet a. Tuachi’n Israel mite lah a natpi khu athengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh tambang natpi a shite khu tul sawmni leh tul li ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupia, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Siempu Aaron tapa Eleazar tapa Phinehas in ka thangsietna banga alah ua athangpainain ka lungthahna Israel tate lah akipat a khinkheta hi, tuachi’n ka lungthahna ziehin Israel tate ka sumang nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ngaiin kilemna thuhun atungah ka hung ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh ama leh anua a, ahahasuonte dingin kumtawnna siempu hina thuhun ahi dinga, a Pasian thangsietna khu athangsietpi zieh leh Israel tate ding a, kilemna abawlpieh zieh in, chiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Israel pasal Midian numeinu khat toh athapa uh min khu Salu tapa Zimri ahia, Simeon phung sunga azungpipa uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Midian numei atha uh min khu Zur tanu Kozbi ahia, Midiante phung khat sunga upa khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupia, akungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Midian mite khu sumangbang unlen, that gam sieng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun zong Peor zieha natpi tun nia kithat a sanggamnu uh Midian lamkai khat tanu Kozbi tungtang leh Peor mun a thu piengte ziehin khelpil tah in ahing sumangbang uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh gawtna aven nuain hichi ahing hi a, Mangpa’n Mosi leh siempu Aaron tapa Eleazar ahoupi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mipi kikhawmte zousie kum sawmni apat atunglam teng, aphung aphung un, Israel gam a gal kuon thei ding zousie sim in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi leh siempu Eleazar in Moab phaijang a, Jordan gei a Jerikou kungah amaute ahoupi ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mipite kum sawmni apat atunglam teng sim un,” Mangpa’n Mosi leh Izipt gam a kipata hing pawtdoh Israel tate thu apieh bangin, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Reuben Israel ta upa pen: Reuben tate Hanok phung kipatna Hanok mite, Pallu akipat Pallu mite inn kuon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hezron akipat Hezron mite innkuon, Karmi apat Karmi mite innkuon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamte khu Reuben mite innkuonte ahi uhi, akisim zousie tul sawmli leh tul thum leh za sagi leh sawmthum ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pallu tapa Eliab ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Eliab tate, Nemuel, Dathan leh Abiramte ahi uhi, tamte khu Mangpa aphin lai ua Korah toh kithuo a, Mosi leh Aaron kal a mipi kikhawmte lah a tel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh tua mi pawlte ashi lai un, lei in akam akah lai in Korahte toh avaltum khawm a, mei in zani leh sawm nga akahtum laiin: Tuachi’n chiemtena ahing hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Korah tate ashi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A innkuon dungzui ua, Simeon tapate. Nemuel tapate: Nemuel apat Nemuel mite: Jamin apat Jemin mite: Jakin apat Jakinmite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerah apat Jerahmite, Shaul apat Shaulmite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tamte khu Simeon innkuon hahlesuonte ahi ua, tul sawmni leh tul ni leh zani ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A innkuon dungzui ua Gad tapate: Zephon apat Jephonmite, Haggi apat Haggimite, Shuni apat Shunimite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ozni apat Oznimite, Eri apat Erimite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Arod apat Arodmite, Areli apat Arelimite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tamte khu Gad tate hahlesuonte ahi uhi. Akisim na uh dungzuiin, tul sawmli leh zanga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda tapate khu Er leh Onan ahi ua, Er leh Onan khu Kanaan gamah ashita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh a innkuon bang dungzui ua Juda tapate khu Shelah apat Shelahmite innkuon, Perez apat Perezmite innkuon, Zerah apat Zerahmite innkuon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Pharez tapate khu Hezron apat Hezronmite innkuon, Hamul apat Hamulmite innkuon ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tamte Juda innkuonte ahi uhi, akisimna uh dungzuiin tul sawm sagi leh tul guh leh za nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A innkuon bang dungzui ua, Issakar tapate khu Tola apat Tolamite, innkuon, Pua apat Puamite innkuon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jashub apat Jashubmite, innkuon, Shimron apat Shimronmite innkuon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tamte khu Issakar innkuonte akisimna uh dungzuiin tul sawmguh leh tul li leh zathum ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A innkuon bang dungzui ua Zebulun tapate khu Sered apat Seredmite innkuon, Elon apat Elonmite innkuon, Zahlel apat Zahlelmite innkuon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tamte khu Zebulun innkuonte akisimna uh dungzuiin tul sawmguh leh za nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A innkuon bang dungzui ua Joseph tapate khu Manasseh leh Ephraim ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Manasseh tapate ahileh Makir apat Makirmite innkuon tualeh Makir in Gilead ahinga, Gilead apat Gileadmite innkuon ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tamte khu Gilead tapate ahi uhi, Jeezer apat Jeezermite innkuon, Helek apat Helekmite innkuon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Asriel apat Asrielmite innkuon, Shekem apat Shekemmite innkuon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Shemida apat Shemidamite innkuon, Hepher apat Hephermite innkuon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh Hepher tapa Zelophehad in tapa anei sih a, Hinanleh tanute anei hi. Tualeh Zelophehad tanute min khu Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milkah tualeh Tirzah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tamte khu Manasseh innkuonte ahi ua, akisim dan dungzuiin, tul sawmnga leh tul ni leh za sagi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tamte khu a innkuon bang dungzui ua, Ephraim tapate ahi uhi, Shuthelah apat Shuthelahmite innkuon, Becher apat Bechermite innkuon, Tahan apat Tahanmite innkuon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh tamte khu Shuthelah tapate ahi uhi; Eran apat Eranmite innkuon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tamte khu Ephraim tapate innkuon ahi ua, akisimna uh dungzuiin tul sawm thum leh tul ni leh za nga ahi uhi. Tamte khu a innkuon dungzui a, Joseph tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A innkuon uh dung zui a, Benjamin tapate, Bela apat Belamite, innkuon, Ashbel apat Ashbel mite innkuon Ahiram apat Ahirammite innkuon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Shupham apat Shuphammite innkuon, Hupham apat Huphammite innkuon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh Bela tapate khu Ard leh Naaman ahi uhi. Ard apat Ardmite innkuon, Naaman apat Naamanmite innkuon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tamte a innkuon bang dungzui ua Benjamin tapate ahi uhi. Tualeh amaute kisimna dungzuiin tul sawmli leh tul nga leh za guh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tamte khu a innkuon uh dungzuiin Dan tapate ahi uhi. Shuham apat Shuhammite innkuon; Tamte khu a innkuon uh dungzuiin Dan innkuonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Shuhammite innkuonte zousie akisimna dungzuiin tul sawm guh leh tul li leh zali ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Asher tapate a innkuon uh dungzui in Jimna apat Jimnamite innkuon, Jesui apat Jesuimite innkuon, Beriah apat Beriahmite innkuon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Beriah tapate ahileh Heber apat Hebermite innkuon, Malkiel apat Malkielmite innkuon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh Asher tanu min khu Sarah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tamte khu a innkuon bang dungzui ua, Asher tapate ahi uhi, akisimna dungzui un, tul sawm nga leh tul thum leh zali ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Naphtali tapate a innkuon uh dungzuiin, Jahzeel apat Jahzeelmite innkuon Guni apat Gunimite innkuon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jezer apat Jezermite innkuon: Shillem apat Shillemmite innkuon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tamte khu a innkuon uh dungzuiin, Naphtali innkuonte ahi uhi; akisimna dungzui un tul sawmli leh tul nga leh za sagi leh sawmli ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tamte khu Israel tate kisim teng ahi ua, tul za guh leh tul khat leh zasagi leh sawmthum ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />“Tamte kungah gam khu agoutan ding ua amin phaza dungzui ua hawmpieh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />A phung tamte kungah goutan lien na pe dinga, a phung tawmte kungah goutan neudeu nape ding hi, mi chin kungah akisim bang dungzuiin atan ding chiet uh na pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hinanleh gam khu aisan a hawm ding ahi. Apute uh phung min dungzuiin gam khu atang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Aisan dungzuiin gam tan khu atam leh atawmte kunga hawm ahi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tamte khu a innkuon uh dungzui a, Levimi kisimte ahi uhi. Gershon apat Gershonmite innkuon, Kohath apat Kohathmite innkuon, Merari apat Merarimite innkuon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tamte khu Levimite innkuon ahi uhi. Libnimite innkuon, Hebron mite innkuon, Mahlimite innkuon, Mushimite innkuon, Korathmite innkuon. Tualeh Kohath in Amram ahing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tualeh Amram zi min khu Jokebed Levi tanu ahia, Izipt gam a Levi lah a pieng ahia, Amanu’n Amram dingin Aaron, Mosi leh asanggamnu Miriam ahin pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tualeh Aaron in Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar leh Ithamar ahing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Nadab leh Abihu in Mangpa masanga mei sienglou a lat lai un ashita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama ulah a akisim zousie pasal ha khat apat atung lam teng tul sawmni leh tul thum ahi uhi. Israel mite leh gam kihawm tanglou ding ahi zieh un, Israel tate lah a simtel ahi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tamte khu Jerikou kunga Jordan gei a, Moab phaijanga Israel tate simpa Mosi leh siempu Eleazar in asimte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Hinanleh Sinai gamdai a, Israel tate Mosi leh siempu Aaron in asimte lah ua khat zong a um, a um non sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Aziehpen “Mangpa’n gamdai ah ashigam ngei ngei ding uh ahi ana chi sa ahi ta hi,” Jephune tapa Kaleb leh Nun tapa Joshua chilou koima adam a um non sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joseph tapa Manasseh phung sunga mi Manasseh tapa, Makir tapa Gilead tapa, Hepher tapa Zelophehad tanute ahing pei ua, tamte atanute min ahi, Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah Milkah leh Tirzah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh amaute kimutuona biehbuh mai ah Mosi leh siempu Eleazar leh miliente leh mipi kikhawmte zousie masangah ading ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka pa uh gamdai ah ashita a, Mangpa tung a hel dinga kikhawm Korah pawlte lah ah apang sih a, hinanleh ama khelna ziehin ashi a, tapa anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bang dinga tapa aneilou zieha ka pa uh min a innkuonte lah apat phietmanga um ding ahiei mah? Tuaziehin ka pa uh sanggamte lah ah tanvou ding hing pie un,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in athu uh Mangpa masangah atun ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Zelophehad tanute thugen adih ahi, amaute apa uh unaute lah ah goutan na bawl pieh ding a apa uh goutan khu amaute na pieh sawn ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate kungah, Mi tapa neilou a ashi leh agou atanute na pieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tanu anei sih leh agou asanggam pasalte kungah na pe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachia sanggam pasal anei sih leh agou khu apa unau pasalte kungah na pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Apa’n sanggam pasal anei sih leh agou khu a innkuonte lah a akinaipipen na pe ding a; aman atang ding hi. Mangpa’n Mosi kunga thu apieh bang in Israel mite dingin dan leh thupieh a umden ding ahi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi kungah, “Abarim muolvum ah kaltou inlen Israel tate kunga ka pieh gam khu va en in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Na va et zou chiengin na sanggampa Aaron bangin, nang zong na mipite toh puikhawm in na umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Zin gamdai a mipi kikhawmte a phun lai ua, amit mu ua, tui a Kei hing pahtawi dinga, ka hing thupieh kal a na hel zieh ahi;” tuakhu Zin gamdai a, Kadesh a Meribah tuite ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Mangpa ahoupi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mangpa tahsa hagau zousie Pasian in mipi kikhawmte tunga um dingin mikhat guot heh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa mipi kikhawmte ching ding neilou belam hon bang ahilouna dingun, amaute puidoh a, tualeh puilut dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi kungah “Nun tapa Joshua mi lungsim neitah zawpi inlen atungah na khut ngam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh ama khu siempu Eleazar leh mipi kikhawmte zousie masangah dingsah inlen amit mu uah thu neina pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Israel mipi kikhawm zousieten athu azui theina dingun, atungah na thuneina khenkhat pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama siempu Eleazar masangah ading dinga, aman Mangpa masangah Urim thukhenna in thu adong ding hi; ama thu in apawtdoh ding ua, ama thu main alut ding uhi, ama leh Israel mipi kikhawmte zousie,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Mangpa’n thu apieh bangin abawl a Joshua azawpi a, siempu Eleazar leh mipi kikhawmte masang ah adingsah a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh atungah akhut angama, Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin thuneina apeta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel tate thu pie inlen, akung uah genin, kei a dinga gimnamtui dinga mei a sillat kithoina ding ka sillat leh ann khu ahun chiet uah ka kungah nalan zel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh akung uah tami mei a sillat Mangpa kunga na sillat ding uh ahi: belamnou atal kum khat a upa, gensietbei nichin in ni, halmang sillat a lat gige ding in, gen in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Belamnou khat pen zingmawng lam in lan inlen, a dang khatpen nitah lam chienga na lat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ann sillat dingin tangbuong nel ephah sesawm suo sekhat, sathau kihehsa hin se li suo sekhat toh kihal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami Mangpa dinga gimnamtui dinga, mei a sillat kithoina, Sinai muol a kiguotsa bawlzom zing ding halmang sillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh dawn sillat pen belamnou khat a dingin hin seli suo sekhat ahi dinga; Mangpa dinga dawn sillat uoin chia khu mun siengthou a na buohsuh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Belamnou khat pen nitahlam chiengin na lan ding hi; zingmawnga ann sillat leh dawn sillat bangin mei a sillat Mangpa dinga gimnamtui na lan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tualeh khawlni in kum khat a upa nuolnabei belamnou ni leh ann sillat dingin tangbuong nelte ephah sesawm suo seni sathau toh kihal leh tua dawn sillat toh na lat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam khawlni china halmang sillat, lat ngitnget leh khum dawn sillat simlou a, halmang sillat lat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Na ha tha tengun Mangpa adingin halmang sillat na lan ding ua, bawngtal tuoi ni leh belam tal khat, belamnou melhemlou kum khat a upa sagi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh bawngtal khat chiet adingin ann sillat dingin tangbuong nel ephah sesawm suo sethum, sathau toh kihal, tualeh belamtal khat a dingin ann sillat dingin tangbuong nel ephah sesawm suo seni sathau toh kihal ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh belamnou khat chiet ah ann sillat a dingin tangbuong nel sathau toh kihal ephah sesawm suo sekhat, tami halmang sillat gimnamtui Mangpa adinga mei a sillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh a dawn sillatte ukhu bawngtal khat adingin uoin hin kim khat ahi dinga, belamtal khat adingin hin se thum suo sekhat, tualeh belamnou khat a dingin hin seli suo sekhat, tamte kum khat sunga ha chin a halmang dingte khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh keltal khat zong, Mangpa kunga khelna kithoina sillat a na lat ding ahi; dawn sillat leh tawplou a sillat dingte simlou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tualeh ha khatna ni sawm leh li ni khu Mangpa peikan pawi a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh tami ha ni sawm leh nga ni khu annkuongluini ahia; ni sagi sung tanghou tolsawlou na neh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni khat niin khawmpi siengthou a um dinga; nna mawngmawng na sep ding uh ahi sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa dinga halmang sillat dingin mei a kithoina sillat na lan ding uhi, bawngtal tuoi ni leh belamtal khat leh belamnou kum khat a upa sagi, tuate khu nuolnabei ahi ding chi na thei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh a ann sillatte ukhu tangbuong sathau toh kihal ahi ding hi, bawngtal khat adingin ephah sesawm suo sethum leh belamtal khat a dingin Ephah se sawm suo seni ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Belamnou sagite adingin ephah se sawm suo sekhat chiet ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh nouma dingin kilem na bawlna dinga khelna sillat dingin keltal khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tamte khu zingmawng a halmang sillat, tawplou a lat ding halmang sillat simlou a na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tambangmain Mangpa dinga gimnamtui mei a sillat neh ding nichin in, ni sagi sung na lat ding uh ahi; tawplou a halmang sillat leh dawn sillat simlou in, na lan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh ni sagi niin khawmpi siengthou na nei ding ua, nna mawngmawng na sep lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tualeh na nipikal pawi u’leh na ga masa pawi ni chieng ua, Mangpa dinga ann tha sillat haithate na hing lat ni chieng un zong khawmpi siengthou na nei ding ua; nna nasep ding uh ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mangpa dinga gimnamtui halmang sillat na lan ding uhi; bawngtal tuoi ni, belamtal khat, belamnou kum khat a upa sagi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A ann sillat uh, tangbuong neel sathau toh kihal, bawngtal khat chiet adingin ephah se sawm suo sethum belamtal khat chiet adingin ephah se sawmsuo se ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh belamnou teng adingin ephah sesawm suo sekhat chiet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nouma dinga kilemna bawlna dingin keltal nou khat zong na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ann sillat leh akilan zomzing halmang sillat chilou, dawn sillat toh na lan khawm ding uhi, na sillatte uh nuolnabei ahi ding uh, chi thei un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tualeh Ha sagina ani khat niin khawmpi siengthou na bawl ding uh ahi, nna nasep ding uh ahi sih hi. Nouma dinga pengkul mutni ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa kungah gimnamtui halmang sillat na lan ding ua, bawngtal tuoi khat, belamtal khat, belamnou atal kum khat a upa sagi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh a ann sillat ua dingin tangbuong nel sathau toh kihal, bawngtal adingin ephah khat sesawm suo sethum, belamtal adingin sesawm suo seni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh belamnou sagite khat chiet adingin ephah khat sesawm suo sekhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh nouma adinga kilemna bawlna dingin khelna sillat dingin keltal nou khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tamteng ban ah, ha tha halmang sillat leh ann sillat, nichin halmang sillat leh ann sillat leh a dawn sillatte uh thupieh dan dungzui in Mangpa dinga gimnamtui dinga mei a sillate simlou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tualeh aha sagina ni sawmni in khawmpi siengthou na nei ding uhi, tualeh na hinna uh na sugim ding ua, tua hun sungin nna mawngmawng nasep lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa kungah gimnamtui halmang sillat na lat ding uh ahi, bawngtal tuoi khat belamtal khat tualeh kum khat a upa belamnou sagi, tuate nuolnabei ahi ngei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ann sillat uh, tangbuong nel sathau toh kihalsa bawngtal khat a dingin ephah khat sesawm suo sethum tualeh belamtal khat adingin ephah sesawm suo seni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Belamnou sagite dingin, ephah sesawm suo sekhat chiet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n kilemna bawlna dinga khelna sillat, tualeh tawplou a halmang sillat leh ann sillat leh dawn sillatte ban ah khelna sillat dingin keltal khat zong na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tualeh aha sagina ni sawm leh nga niin, khawmpi siengthou na nei ding ua; nna mawngmawng na sem sih ding uhi, tualeh Mangpa dingin ni sagi sung pawi na mang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa dinga gimnamtui mei a kithoina halmang sillat na lat ding uh ahi, bawngtal tuoi sawm leh thum, belamtal ni, tualeh belamnou kum khat a upa sawm leh li, gensietbei chiet ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh a ann sillat uh, tangbuong nel sathau toh kihal khawm ahiding, bawngtal sawm leh thum, bawngtal khat chiet adingin ephah khat se sawm suo sethum, belamtal khat chiet a dingin sesawm suo seni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Belam nou sawm leh li, belamnou khat adingin sesawm suo sekhat chiet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tawplou a halmang sillat, ann sillat leh dawn sillatte simlou in khelna kithoina sillat dingin keltal khat zong na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ani ni niin bawngtal tuoi sawm leh ni, belamtal ni, belamnou kum khat a upa nuolnabei sawm leh li na lan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Danpieh dungzuiin, atam leh tawm dan un bawngtalte, belamtalte leh belamnoute toh lat khawm dingin, ann sillat leh dawn sillat zong ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh akizom a halmang sillat, a ann sillat, a dawn sillalte uh simlou in khelna sillat dingin keltal khat zong na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Ani thum ni chiengin, bawngtal sawm leh khat, belamtal ni, belamnou kum khat a upa nuolnabei sawm leh li;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh danpieh dungzui in atam leh tawm dan un bawngtalte, belamtalte leh belamnoute toh lat khawm dingin, ann sillat leh dawn sillatte zong ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh halmang sillat, ann sillat leh dawn sillat simlou in keltal khat zong khelna sillat dingin na lan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ani li niin bawngtal sawm, belamtal ni, belamnou kum khat a upa nuolnabei sawm leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Dan pieh dungzuiin, atam leh tawm dan un bawngtalte belamtalte leh belamnoute toh lat khawm dingin ann sillat leh dawn sillatte zong ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tawplou a halmang sillat, ann sillat leh dawn sillat na lat uh simlou in keltal khat khelna sillat dinga na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ani nga niin, bawngtal kuo, belamtal ni, belamnou kum khat a upa, nuolnabei sawm leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Danpieh dungzuiin atam leh tawm dan un bawngtalte, belamtalte leh belamnou toh lat khawm dingin, ann sillat leh dawnding sillat zong ahi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh tawplou a halmang sillat, ann sillat leh dawn sillat simlou in, keltal khat khelna sillat a na lat ding uh, ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ani guh niin, bawngtal giet, belamtal ni, belamnou kum khat upa nuolnabei sawm leh li,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Danpieh dungzuiin atam leh tawm dan un, bawngtalte, belamnoute toh lat khawm dingin, ann sillat leh dawn sillatte zong ahi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh tawplou a halmang sillat, ann sillat leh dawn sillat simlou in keltal khat khelna sillat dinga na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Ani sagini in, bawngtal sagi, belamtal ni belamnou kum khat a upa nuolnabei sawm leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Danpieh dungzuiin atam leh tawm dan un bawngtalte, belamtalte leh belamnoute toh lat khawm ding, ann sillat leh dawn sillatte zong ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tawplou a halmang sillat, ann sillat leh dawn sillatte, simlou in, khelna sillat dingin keltal khat na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Ani giet niin, khawmpi thupitah na nei ding ua, tua hun sungin nna mawngmawng nasep ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mangpa adinga gimnamtui dingin mei a kithoina halmang sillat na lan ding uhi: bawngtal khat, belamtal khat belamnou kum khat a upa nuolnabei sagi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Danpieh dungzuiin atam leh tawm dan un, bawngtalte, belamtalte leh belamnoute toh lat khawm dingin, ann sillat leh dawn sillatte zong ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tawplou a halmang sillat, ann sillat leh dawn sillatte simlou in, khelna sillat dingin keltal khat zong na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Tam silte khu na pawi hunguotte uah, Mangpa kungah na lan ding uhi, na halmang sillatte uh ding leh na ann sillatte uh ding leh na dawn sillatte uh ding leh na lemna sillatte uh ding a na thuchiemte u’leh na kiphalna sillatte uh simlou in,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh zousie bangin Mosi in Israel tate ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Israel tate phung sunga lamkaite a houpi a; “Tami ahi Mangpa thupieh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi’n Mangpa kunga thu achiem ahiei ahisihleh lungsim a amaleh ama kigah a, akichiem leh athuchiem apel ding ahi sih, akam a pawt bang banga abawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Numei in anungah lai a, apa inn a, a um lai in, Mangpa kungah thu achiema, athuchiem ah akigah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh apa’n akichiemna leh amaleh ama thuchiem a, akigahna thu zanapi a, bangma genlou a aumleh akichiemna zousie a supiching dinga, tualeh thuchiem a akigahna zousie adet ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh apa’n azah ni a, aphal sihleh, athuchiemte akigahna thuchiemten amanu akan kha nawnsih ding hi; apa’n aphal louziehin Mangpa’n amanu angaidam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thuchiem lai a, ahisihleh athuchiemin amanu agah zinglai a pasal anei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Apasal in tam thute azah a, azahni a bangma agen sihleh akichiemna atangtung dinga, akigahna thuchiem zong adet ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh apasal in tam thu azah nia aphal sih leh akichiemna leh akigahna akam a agente khu bangmalou asuoh dinga, Mangpa’n amanu angaidam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Meithai leh akikhul numei in amaleh ama kigah a akichiemna ukhu a det ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh apasal innsunga kichiemna anei a, ahisihleh amaleh ama kigah a thuchiem abawl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Apasal in tam thute azah a, asipsan a, a awimawsih leh akichiemna zousie a tangtung ding a, akigahna thuchiem zousie zong a det ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh apasal in tua thute azah nia, bangmalou asuohsah leh athuchiem tungtanga akam a pawt pouma leh amaleh ama kigahna zousie adet sih dinga, apasal in bangmalou asuo sah tah zieh in, Mangpa’n amanu angaidam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kichiemna zousie leh amanu hinna sugenthei dinga kichiemna zousie apasal in asudet thei dinga ahisihleh bangmalou asuoh sah thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh apasal in azah nia kipata bangma agen sihleh, akichiemna zousie leh kigahna zousie anamdet ahi; azah nia bangma agenlou ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh azah nua a, bangmalou asuoh sah leh aman amanu mawna apo ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamte khu apasal leh azi leh apa leh atanu anungah lai a, apa inn a a um lai a, akikal ua dan thupieh dinga Mangpa’n Mosi kunga thu apieh khu ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Midianmite tungah Israel tate phuba lain: Tuazou chiengin na mite kunga pui nahita ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in mipite ahoupi a, a kung uah, “Na lah uah mi bangza ahiei kigalthuom u’henlen Midiante dou dingin kuon uhenlen, Midianmite tungah Mangpa phuba vala uheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel phung zousie lah a, phung china mi, tul khat, galdou dingin na sawl ding uh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tul tampite lah a, phung chin a kipan in tul khat chiet; kidouna a kuon dingin galkap tul sawm leh tul ni apekhe ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in phung chin apat, mi tul khat chiet leh siempu Eleazar tapa, Phinehas khu mun siengthou a vanzahte leh thupieh nadinga mut ding, pengkulte kengin kidou dingin asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin, Midiante adou ua, pasal zousie athat ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh amithate lah uah Midiante leengte zong atel uhi, Midiante leeng nga athate uh min: Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur leh Reba ahi uhi. Beor tapa Balaam zong namsau in athat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Midian numeite zousie atangehte u’toh sal in apui ua, aganhon zousie u’leh a belamhon zousie u’leh anei alam zousie uh, agallah sum dingun ala uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh atenna khopite zousie u’leh akulpi zousie uh mei in ahaltum pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh mihing leh ganta, galmat leh gallah sum zousie apeipi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun galmatte, salte leh gallah sum zousie, Mosi leh Siempu Eleazar leh Israel mipi kikhawmte kungah, Jerikou gal Jordan luipanga um Moab phaijang a, agiehphuol uah ahing tut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi leh siempu Eleazar leh mipi kikhawmte lamkai zousie giehphuol pulam ah amaute vaidawn dingin a kuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi khu, galkap lamkaite, tul khat tunga lamkai, za khat tunga lamkaite tungah alungthahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in, akung uah, “Numei zousie nang hing khawi uh ave maw? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngaiun, Balaam lemguotna ziehin Peor tungtang thu ah Israel tate Pasian tunga atakhielsah ua, tuachi’n Mangpa mipi kikhawmte lah ah mi puul ahing tungsah uh hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuazieh in naupang teng lah a pasal zousie that unlen, tualeh numei, pasal toh lumkhawmsa zousie zong that un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh numei naupang pasal toh lumkhawmkha nailoute khu nouma dingin hingkhawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh giehphuol pulam daigei ah ni sagi gieh unlen, mi koi zong mithat leh mi kithatsate khoikha pouma ani thum ni leh ani sagi niin nouma leh nasuoh nasalte u’zong kisusiengthou ta un, achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh na puonsil zousie uh, savun a kibawl zousie leh kelmul a kigan sil zousie tualeh singa kibawl sil zousie na suhsieng ding uh ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh siempu Eleazar in kidouna a kuon galkapte kungah, “Tami Mangpa’n Mosi kunga apieh dan thugousie khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangteng hileh, sanate, dangkate, sum-eng te, Siate langva leh hangehte leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mei a ka theilou sil pouma, mei ah na hal ding ua, tuachi’n a siengthou ding, hinanleh suhsiengna tui a suh sieng ahi ding uhi; tualeh mei a katum thei zousie tui a sawpsieng ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh ni sagi niin na puonte uh na sawp sieng ding ua, na siengta ding uh, tuazou chiengin giehphuol ah na hing lut ding uhi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nang leh siempu Eleazar leh mipi kikhawmte phung upate toh, na galmatte uh mihing leh gantate zousie leh vante sim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tueleh galvan lahte khu mun ni ah khen un; galdoudinga kidouna a kuonte ading leh mipi kikhawmte a dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh galdou dinga kidouna a kuonte apat Mangpa dinga sie a apieh ding uh koituom zel unlen, mihingte lah a kipat in, bawngte lah a kipat in, sabiltungte lah a kipat in, belamte lah a kipat in za khat chiet tuom koidoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuate khu akimkhat la unlen siempu Eleazar kungah Mangpa vei sillat dingin pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate tan kimkhat apat in, sawmnga lah a khat na la dinga, mihing apat bang, bawnga pat bang, sabiltunga pat bang, belam apat bang leh ganta phot a kipat bang ladoh inlen, tuate khu Mangpa biehbuh kem Siempute kungah na pieh ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi leh siempu Eleazar in Mangpa’n Mosi kunga athupieh bangin abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh galkapten a mat uh, gallah sumte simlou a, alah uh, belam tul zaguh leh tul sawm sagi leh tul nga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bawng tul sawm sagi leh tul ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sabiltung tul sawm guh leh tul khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh mihing: numei pasal toh lumkhawm kha nailou tul sawm thum leh tul ni, ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh akimkhat, gal a kuon galkapte tanvou ahia atam lam, belam tul zathum leh tul sawmthum leh tul sagi leh za nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa dinga sie a kipie, belam zaguh leh sawm sagi leh nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh bawng, tul sawmthum leh tul guh ahia, tua lahah Mangpa dinga sie a kipie, sawm sagi leh ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh sabiltung tul sawmthum leh za nga ahi, tua lah ah Mangpa dinga sie a kipie, sawm guh leh khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh mihing tul sawm leh guh ahia, Mangpa dinga sie a kipie sawm thum leh ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin, Mangpa vei sillat dingin sie, Siempu Eliazar kungah apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in galkap mite tanvou apieh zou a Israel mite tanvou khu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Belam tul zathum leh tul sawm thum leh tul sagi leh za nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Bawng tul sawm thum leh tul guh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Sabiltung tul sawmthum leh zanga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh mihing tul sawm leh tul guh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate tanvou kimkhat apat in Mosi in mihing leh ganta sawmnga leh khat ala a, Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin, Mangpa biehbuh kem Levite kungah apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap lamkai, tul tunga lamkai leh za tunga lamkaite Mosi kungah ang pei ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mosi kungah, “Na suohten ka khut ua um galkap mite ka sim ua, koima akimlou ka um sih uhi achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka hinna dingun Mangpa masanga kilemna bawlna dingin, Mangpa ding sillat michin in ka nei sun uh sana a kibawl kizepna vante, banbute, taute, minnamna khutsipte, bilbate leh khite, ka hing tawi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi leh Siempu Eleazar in, sana a kisiem akivonna zousie uh ala ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />tul tunga lamkaite leh za tunga lamkaite sana, Mangpa kunga vei sillat a alat zousie uh shekel tul sawm leh tul guh leh za sagi leh sawm nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />(Galkap miten agallah sum uh amaun akitan uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi leh Eleazar in a tul tunga, lamkaite leh aza tunga lamkaite sana ala ua, Israel tate thei zingna dingin kimutuona biehbuh ah Mangpa masang ah ahing tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Reuben leh Gad taten ganta tampi anei ua, tualeh Jazer gam leh Gilead gam amu tahun, tua mun khu ganhon dinga mun hoitah hiin athei ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gad tate leh Reuben taten Mosi leh siempu Eleazar leh mipi kikhawmte lamkaite ahoupi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ataroth gamte, Dibon gamte, Jazer gamte, Nimrah gamte, Heshbon gamte, Elealeh gamte, Shebam gamte Nebo gamte leh Beon gamte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mipi kikhawmte masanga Mangpa’n asuh mang gamte khu gantate dinga gamhoi ahi a, na suohten ganhon ka hau uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin “Na mitmu a deisahna katan u’leh tam gam na suohte kung ah ka luo dingun hing pie inlen, Jordan gal hing kaipi da mai in chi’n ahing gen uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Gad tate leh Reuben tate kungah, “Na unaute uh galdou a kuon ding ua, noute tam mun a tou mai ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangdinga Mangpa’n amauh apieh gam a lutlou dinga Israel tate lung kesah na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tambangmain napu leh pate un Kadesh-Barnea akipat a gam enkhe dinga ka sawl laiin abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen amaute Eshkol phaijang dong ava tung ua, a gam ava mu tahun Mangpa’n amauh apieh gam lutlou dingin Israel tate alung kesah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n, tua niin Mangpa lungthahna khu meibangin akuongdoh a, tualeh akichiem ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izipt gam akipat a hing pawtdoh, kum sawm ni apat atung lam, mi mawngmawng in, Abraham, Isaak leh Jakob kunga kichiema ka pieh gam khu, lungsim siengthou taha ahing zuilou zieh un koiman amu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keniz mi Jephuneh tapa Kaleb leh Nun tapa Joshua chiloungal, aziehpen amauten Mangpa azui bukim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua Mangpa lungthahna khu Israelte tungah, akuong ta a, Mangpa mit mu a sil gilou bawl mite khang zousie abeimang sieng masangsie uh gamdai ah kum sawmli sung avahvai sah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh ngai un, Israel tunga Mangpa lungthahna zauhuoitah belap dingin nou khang giloute na pate uh taangin na dingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa zuilou a, na kiheimangsan ngeingei u’leh Aman amaute gamdai ah anuasie kia mai ding ahi, tualeh tam mite zousie na mangthaisah sieng ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh amaute akungah ahing peikia ua, “Ka ganhonte ua dingin, belam honte leh ka taneute ua dingin khopite ka bawl ding ua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh koute ahileh, amaute amun ding ua, ka lutsah masang sie uh, Israel tate masang a pei zel dingin ka kigalvon ding uhi; tam gam mite ziehin ka taneute uh kulpi nei khopite ah ateng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel tate mi chinin agamluo ding uh aluo chiet masangsie un, ka inn lam uah ka kinuale sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen koute gamluo ding Jordan gal nisuoh lam ahi ziehin, Jordan gal khatlam leh akallam ka luopi sih ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in akung uah, “Tam sil na bawl ua, galdou dinga Mangpa masanga, kigalvon a na pei ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amasanga kipata, melmate na nawmang masangsie ua, Jordan gal a Mangpa masanga na bawn ua kigalvon a na pei ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa masanga gal zaw ahi zou chiengin, na hing kinuale ding ua, Mangpa masang leh Israelte masangah mawnabei na hi ding uh, tualeh tam gam Mangpa masangah na luo ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh tuabanga na bawl sih u’leh, Ngaiun, Mangpa tungah sil na bawl khiel uh ahi dinga, na khelna un ahing mukhe ngei ngei ding chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na ta neute ua dingin khopite bawl unlen, na belamte ua dingin belam huongte bawl unlen, tualeh na kam ua thu pawtsa khu bawl ngei ngei un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Gad tate leh Reuben tate’n Mosi kungah, “Na suohten ka pu uh thupieh bangin ka bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka ta neute uh, ka zite uh, ka belamhonte u’leh ka ganhonte uh, Gilead khopite ah ana um ding ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh na suohte pen ka pu uh gen bangin galdou dingin Mangpa masangah mi chin kigalvon in kava galkai ding uhi, chi’n agen uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in amaute tungthu ah siempu Eleazar leh Nun tapa Joshua leh Israel phung sunga upa pente thu apie a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in akung uah, “Gad tate leh Reuben tate, kidou dinga kigalvon zousieten Mangpa masangah Jordan gal ahing kaipi ua, tualeh na masang ua gam na zaw u’leh, Gilead gam pen aluo ding ua na pieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh kigalvon a ahing galkaipi sih u’leh, Kanaan gam ah na lah uah atel mai ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Gad tate leh Reuben taten “Na suohte kunga Mangpa’n agen bangin ka bawl ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kigalvon a Mangpa masanga galkai in, Kanaan gam ah ka lut ding ua, tuachi’n ka gam luo ding uh pen Jordan luigal tam langpang ahi ding hi,” chiin adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Gad tate leh Reuben tate kungah tualeh Joseph tapa Manasseh nam kimkhatte kungah, Amormite leengpa Sihon gam, Bashan leengpa Og gam, tualeh tua gamte leh akhopi teng leh akimvel gam khopite toh, apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Gad taten Dibon leh Ataroth leh Aroer toh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Atroth, Sophan, Jaazer, Jogbehah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Beth-nimrah tualeh Beth-haran, khopi kulpi neite leh belam huongte abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Reuben tate Heshbon, Elealeh leh Kirjathaim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nebo leh Baal Meon (aminte akiheng ta hi) tualeh Sibmah atungdoh ua, a khopi bawlte uh min dang a phuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh Manasseh tapa Makir tate Gilead gam ah ava kuon ua, ala ua, tua muna um Amormite adeldoh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Manasseh tapa Makir khu Gilead gam apeta a, asungah atengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Manasseh tapa Jair in tua khuote avala a, Havoth-Jair aphuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nobah ava kuona, Kenath avala a, akhopite Ama min tapin Nobah aphuo ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosi leh Aaron lamkaina nuoi a, Izipt gam a kipat a, Israel tate apawl apawl ua, apawtdoh lai ua, apei zel dan uh tamte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa thupieh a, apawtdoh ua, apei zel dan uh Mosi in agiel a, apawtdoh ua kipat aban ban a apei nate uh tam munte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahakhatna, ni sawm leh ni nga niin Rameses akipat in akipandoh ua, peikan ni zing niin Israel tate khu Izipt mite mitmu ah hangsan tahin apawtdoh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Izipt mite tachil Mangpa’n athalup piehte avui ua, apasiente uh tungah zong Mangpa’n gawtna atung sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate Rameses akipat in apawtdoh ua, Sukkoth ah giehphuol asat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Sukoth akipat in akipandoh ua, gamdai zul a um Etham ah puon inn azah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Etham a kipat in akisuondoh kia ua, Baal-Zephan suolam pang a um Pi-hahiroth lam ah akinuahei kia ua, Migdol kungah giehphuol asat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Pi-hahiroth mun akipat in akipandoh ua, tuipi apal tan ua, gamdai ah alut ua, Etham gamdai ah nithum apei ua, Marah mun ah giehphuol abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Marah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Elim ahing tung uhi. Elim ah tuinahnei sawm leh ni leh tum kung sawm sagi a um a, tua mun ah giehphuol asat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Elim akipat akisuon ua, tuipi san gei ah giehphuol asat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuipi san akipat akipan doh ua, Sin gamdai ah giehphuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sin gamdai akipat in apawtdoh ua, Dophkah ah giehphuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dophkah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Alush ah giehphuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Alush akipat in apawtdoh ua, Rephidim ah giehphuol abawl ua, tua mun ah mipite dawn ding tui a umsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rephidim akipat in apawtdoh ua, Sinai gamdai ah giehphuol a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sinai gamdai akipat in akipandoh ua, Kibroth-hattavah ah giehphuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kibroth Hattavah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Hazeroth ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hazeroth akipat in akipandoh ua, Rithmah ah giehphuol asat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rithmah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Rimmon Perez ah giehphuol a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rimmon Perez akipat apawtdoh ua, Libnah ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Libnah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Rissah ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rissah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Kehelathah ah giehphuol a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kehelathah akipat apawtdoh ua, Shapher muol ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Shapher muol akipat in apawtdoh ua, Haradah ah giehphuol a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Haradah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Makheloth ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Makheloth akipat in apawtdoh ua, Tahath ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tahath akipat in apawtdoh ua, Terah ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Terah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Mithkah ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mithkah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Hashmonah ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hashmonah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Moseroth ah giehphuol a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Moseroth akipat in apawtdoh ua, Bene-Jaakan ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bene-Jaakan akipat in apawtdoh ua, Hor Hagidgad ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hor Hagidgad akipat in apei ua, Jotbathah ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jotbathah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Abronah ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Abronah akipat in apawtdoh ua, Ezion Geber ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ezion Geber akipat in apawtdoh ua, Zin gamdai a Kadesh ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kadesh akipat in akipandoh ua, Edom gamgi gei a Hor muol ah giehphuol asat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu Aaron khu, Mangpa thupieh in Hor muolvum ah akatou a; Israel mipite Izipt gam a kipat a, ahing pawtdoh uh kum sawm li na ha ngana, ni khat ni’n tua mun ah ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Aaron khu Hor muol a ashi laiin kum za leh sawmni leh thum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuin Kanaan gam simlam a teng, Kanaan mite leengpa Arad in, Israel tate hing pei thu azata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh amaute Hor muol a kipat in ahing kipandoh ua, Zalmonah ah giehphuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Zalmonah hing pawtsan in Punon ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Punon hing pawtsan in, Oboth ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Oboth hing pawtsan in, Iye-Abarimah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Iyim hing pawtsan in Dibon-Gad ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Dibon-Gad akipat in in apawtdoh ua, Almon-Diblathaim ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Almon-Diblathaim akipat in apawtdoh ua, Nebo maijawn a um Abarim muolte ah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Abarim muolte akipat in apawtdoh ua, Jordan gei a Jerikou kung a um Moab phaijangah giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n Beth-eshimoth apat in Abel-Shittim tan dong in, Moab phaijang Jordan lui gei ah giehphuol abawl ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuin Jerikou kunga Jordan lui gei a Moab phaijang ah, Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Israel tate kungah gen inlen, akung uah, Jordan gal kaia, Kanaan gam na lut chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua gam sunga noute masanga na tengte zousie na notdoh ding ua, suonga kikheng amilim zousie uh na suhsiet pieh ding ua, tualeh amilim khenthute uh na suse sieng ding ua, tualeh amun sangte zousie uh na phietmang pieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tua gam sunga tengte na deldoh ding ua, tuachi’n na luoding ua, na teng ding uhi, aziehpen na luo ding ua ka hing piehsa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tualeh aphung dungzuiin aisan in gam na goutan dingun na hawm ding ua, atam deute khu gam lien deu na pe ding ua, atawmte gam neu deu na pe ding ua; michin goutan khu ai-san tuh tuhna ahi ding hi. Napu napete uh phung dungzui in na luoding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hinanleh tua gam a na teng masate na lah ua kipat na nawmang sih u’leh, hichi ahing hi dinga, na lah ua na umden sahte uh khu na mit ua dingin ahing sunthei chiengzum bang ahi ding ua, tualeh na tahsa ua dingin ling bang ahi ding uhi, tualeh na tenna gam uah ahing sugentheite ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tuathamlouin hichi ahi dinga, amaute tunga ka bawl tup bangin noute tunga kabawl ding hi chiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a, akungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel tate thu pie inlen, akung uah gen in, Kanaan gam a na lut chiengun tami na goutan ding ua na khut ua hing lut ding Kanaan gam, agamgite toh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Simlam ah: Simlam a na luo ding chieng ukhu Zin gamdai a kipat Edom gamgi zul ahi dinga, simlam a na gamgi ding ukhu, suolam ah tuipishi gei tawptan ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh na gamgi ukhu, Akrabbim tawn in simlam pangah akawi dinga, tualeh ahing pawtdohna khu Kadesh-Barnea sim lam ah ahidinga, tualeh Hazar-adar ah apei dinga, Azmon ah apei zel ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi Azmon akipat in Izipt luitan in a kawi dinga, atawpna tuipi ah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tualeh tumlam panga gamgi dingin Tuipi lien gamgi in na nei ding ua, tam tumlam gamgi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tam mallam a na gamgi uh ahi ding a, Tui suohgiat a kipat in Hor tang huomin na siem ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Hor tanga kipat in Hamath lutna tan dongin na gamgi uh na siem ding ua, gamgi hing suohdohna Zedadah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi khu Zephron ah apeitou peh dinga, asuohdoh na Hazer-enan ah ahi ding, tam khu na mallam gamgi uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tualeh na suolam gamgi ding ukhu Hazar-enan akipat in Shepham tan dongin na siem ding ua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi khu Shepham a kipat in Riblah tan dongin Ain nisuona lam pangah apei suh dinga, tuachi’n gamgi khu apeisuh zel dinga, suolam a Kinneveth tuipi dongin akihung suh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi khu Jordan dongin apei suh dinga, atawpna khu chituipi dong ahi ding hi. Tami akimvel a gamgi peidan banga, na gam ding uh ahi ding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Israel tate thu apie a, “Tami Mangpa’n nam kuo leh nam kimkhatte kunga pieh dinga thu apieh aisan a na luoding uh gam khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Reuben tapate phung in a innkuon dungzui ua, tualeh Gad tapate phung in a innkuon dungzui ua, tualeh Manasseh phung kimkhat in zong agam luo ding uh amuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Phung ni leh phung kimkhatten agam luoding ukhu Jerikou kung nisuolam Jordan gal tamlang pangah atangta uhi,” chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupia, akungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tamte khu na gam luo ding uh hing hawm pieh dingte min ahi uhi: Siempu Eleazar leh Nun tapa Joshua ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh luo dinga gam hing hawm pieh dingin phung chin a lamkai khat chiet na guot ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua mite min khu tamte ahi uhi: Juda phung apat Jephuneh tapa Kaleb.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Simeon tate phung apat Ammihud tapa Shemuel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin phung apat Kislon tapa Elidad.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dan tate phung lamkai Jogli tapa Bukki.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joseph tate phung lamkai Manasseh tate phunga dingin Ephod tapa Hanniel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Ephraim tate phung lamkai Shiphtan tapa Kemuel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Zebulun tate phung lamkai Parnak tapa Elizaphan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Issakar tate phung lamkai Azzan tapa Paltiel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Asher tate phung lamkai Shelomi tapa Ahihud.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Naphtali tate phunga lamkai Ammihud tapa Padahel ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tamte khu Kanaan gam a, Israel tate kunga gam luo ding hawm dinga, Mangpa’n thu apiehte ahi uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Jerikou kunga, Jordan gei a Moab phaijang ah Mosi ahoupi a, akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel tate thu pie inlen, agam luona uah, Levimite tenna ding khopite apieh ding uh ahi, tualeh Levimite kungah khopi kimvel a gamte zong na pieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khopite khu atenna ding uh ahi dinga, akimvel a gamte khu a bawnghonte u’leh abelamhonte ua ding leh aganta khoite zousie ua ding ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Levimite kunga napieh ding uh khopi kim vel a gam khu khopi kulbang akipat tong tul khat kim kot ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh khopi pulam apat in na te dinga, suolam ah tong tul ni, sim lamah tong tul ni, tumlam ah tong tul ni, tualeh mallam ah tong tul ni. Tuachi’n khopi khu alai ah a um ding hi. Tami ama ua dingin akhopi kim ua agam uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Levite na pieh ding uh khopite lah ah, tuolthatte taina ding, kihumbitna ding khopi guh ahi dinga; tuate chilou khopi sawmli leh ni na pieh be nalai ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levite napieh ding khopi zousie, khopi sawmli leh giet ahi dinga, akimkot gamte toh na pieh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh napieh dinguh khopi khu, Israel tate luosa khopite apat ahi dinga; atam neite a kipat tam na pe ding ua, a tawm neite a kipat tawm na pe ding uhi, michin in Levite kungah agam luo tam leh tawm dan dungzuiin khopite apieh ding uh ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Israel mipite kungah thupie inlen, akung uah, Jordan gal kai a, Kanaan gam na hing lut chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualthatte, tupna mawng neilou a, mithat khate, taina ding kihumbitna khopite na guot ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuate khu nou a dingin phubalami apat kihumbitna khopite ahi ding ua, mipi kikhawm vaihawmte mai a adin masanga tuolthat mi ashilouna dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n nou a dinga kihumbitna dinga na guotte uh khopi guh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jordan gal tam lang pangah khopi thum na guot ding ua, tualeh Kanaan gam sungah khopi thum na guotding uhi, tuate kihumbitna khopite ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam khopi guhte khu, Israel tate ading leh namdangte tualeh alah ua mikhuol tengte a dingin, kihumbitna ahi ding; mi koizong tupna neilou a, tuolthat khate atailut theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hinanleh aman sia hiem zanga asatlup ahi leh tuolthat ahia, pellou a thalia ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh mi shi theina ding khop a akhut a suong a mi ase a ashi leh, tuolthat ahia, tuolthat mi khu thalia ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahisihleh ashina ding khop a singa mi asata, ashi leh tuolthat ahia, tuolthat khu pellou a ashi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sisan phubalapan tuolthatpa khu athat dinga, amu hun hun in athat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh aman amuda zieha, asawnpua a, ahisihleh ana mudapa ana suoma ahileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahisihleh akilungnopmo zieh ua akhut a atupa ashitahleh atumliapa khu thalia ding ahi, aziehpen tuolthat ahi a, sisan phubalapa’n amu hun hun in tuolthat pa khu athat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Hinanleh aman kituohmawna neilou a, thakhat a asawnpua a, ahisihleh aguh a abuh hilou a, atunga bang ahiei khat a aselia khah a ahileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahisihleh amelma lah hiloua, asietna ding tum mawng zong hilou a, ama muloupi a, shi theina ding khop suong ahiei a asekhah a ashi tahleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mipi kikhawmten tam vaihawmna dan dungzuiin mithattu leh sisan phubalatu kikal vai ahawm pieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh mipi kikhawmten tuolthat mi khu sisan phubalami khut apat in ahunkhe ding ua, mipi kikhawmten amapa tailutna kihumbitna khopi ah akoi kia ding ua, tualeh sathau siengthou kinu siempu lien shi masangsie tuamun ah a um den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh bangchihlai pou a, tuolthattu ataina, akihumbitna khopi pulam a ahing pawtdoh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sisan phubalami in, akihumbitna khopi pulam a ama amu a, sisan phubalami in, tuolthatpa atha leh sisan maw apo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen akihumbitna khopi sunga siempu lien shi masangsie aum ding ahia; hinanleh siempu lien shi nua chiengin tuolthatpa khu agam luona ah apei kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tuachi’n tam silte khu na tenna mun zousie ua, na khang tan ua dinga, na vaihawmna dan uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi koi ahiei in mi athaleh tuolthatmi pen theipite kam a kipat a theipitu panna toh tha ding ahi; hinanleh mi khat shi sah na dingin theipitu khat ahun sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuabanah, shina khop a mawpai tuolthatmi, tatna sum na lah ding uh ahi sih; hinanleh ama khu na thalia ngeingei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh siempu lien ashi masangin, akihumbitna khopi a tailut tuolthatmi, agama aum kia nadinga tatna sum na lah dinguh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n na tenna gam uh na suhthanghuoi lou ding uh ahi; sisan in gam khu abua sah a, sisan suomi sisan loungal in, sisan kisuona gam asil sieng thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaziehin na lah ua ka tenna, naluo ding uh gam khu subua sih un, aziahpen Kei Mangpa Israel tate lah ah ka teng hi, chiin” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Joseph tate lah a mi, Manasseh tapa, Makir tapa, Gilead tate phung sunga haitawi upaten Mosi leh lamkaite leh Israel tate phung sunga haitawi upate masangah ahing pei ua, akung uah thu ahing gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amauten “Israel tate kunga ai san a, aluo ding gam uh pe dingin, Mangpa’n ka pu thu ahing pie a, tualeh kapu, ka unaupa uh Zelophehad gam luo ding, a tanute kunga pe dingin Mangpa’n thu ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh amauten Israel tate lah a phung leh taang dang mi pasal neita u’leh ka pulepate uh goutan gam a kipat akilakhe dinga, tuachi’n atuhna phungte uh gamluopa adingin akibelap dinga, tuachi’n ai san a ka gam tansate ua pat lahdoh ahing hita ding hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate Jubili ahing tun chiengin, agamluo ukhu ava tuhna phungte uh gamluo ah belap ahitading a, tuachi’n kou phunga dingin manna ahing hitading hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Mangpa’n thu apieh dungzuiin, “Israel tate thu apie a, Joseph tate phung in agen dih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zelophehad tanute tungtang thu a Mangpa thupieh khu tami ahi, Hoi asah penpen uh kitenpi u’henlen, hinanleh apu apate uh belephung mi toh akiten ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate gamluo khu phung khat a pat phung dangah, akisuon kawi kawi thei sih ding hi, aziehpen Israel tate michin in apulepate uh phung gamluo khu akinei den ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Israel mite lah a gouluoding nei tanu pouman, Israel taten apulepate uh gam aluo chiet theina dingun apa belephung sunga pasal anei ngeingei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A gamluo ukhu phung khat apat phung dang kungah akisuon kawi kawi lou ding ahi; hinanleh Israel tate phunga michin in agamluo uh akinei den dinguh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin Zelophehad tanuten abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Zelophehad tanute Mahlah, Tirzah, Hoglah, Milkah leh Noah in apa uh unaute akitenpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama uten Joseph tapa Manasseh tapate innkuonte akitenpi ua, tuachi’n agamluo ukhu apa innkuonpite phung sungah a um denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tamte khu Mangpa’n Mosi khut a, Jerikou kunga Jordan lui gei Moab phaijang a Israel tate kunga apieh, thupiehte leh vaihawmna dante ahi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
